%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I was prostrating myself.\nMs. Honoka was sobbing.%K%P
我下着跪。\n穗香小姐抽泣着。%K%P
And next to me sat Mitoko, looking sideways with a sour\nexpression.%K%P
而在我的旁边，\n是赌着气别过脸去的都子。%K%P
...Although, I could spot her stealing the occasional\nglance at Ms. Honoka.%K%P
…不过，她时不时向旁边看看，\n在意着穗香小姐。%K%P
This was roughly ten minutes after our reunion. It took\nabout that long for us to clean up and get dressed.%K%P
这是在我们三人再会之后，\n匆忙换好衣服，１０分钟之后的情景了。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWe haven't seen her in a year.\d%K%P
「一年不见了啊，房东小姐」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dShe's as striking as ever. I imagined she would come back\nall skin and bones after being sucked dry by that man.\d%K%P
「还是这么漂亮啊…\n被男人敲骨吸髓了，\n我还以为您只剩一身皮囊了呢」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dUnder normal circumstances, this would be where Mitoko\nsays \dHow dare you show your face around here again, you\nthoughtless harlot,\d but...\d%K%P
「本来的话，\n『还有脸回来啊，你这轻浮的女人！』\n应该是这种场景才对吧…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dTheir reunion was so messed up it made the entire\naccusation process take a sharp 180.\d%K%P
「再会场景太过有冲击性了，\n完美地转移了责任问题啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Wait a second.\nWhat on earth were they doing so early in the morning?\d%K%P
「…等等啊。\n现在是早上吧？\n他们两个在干什么啊？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWell, I can't exactly blame Ms. Landlord for flying off\nthe handle after seeing that.\d%K%P
「看吧，责任转移了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
