%LC美都子
\dYou have nothing to apologize for, Osamu. We were just\nmaking love -- something completely normal between\nlovers.\d%K%P
「理君没什么好道歉的。\n我们是互相爱恋着的。\n刚才的事，是恋人理所当然要做的吧」%K%P
