「不、不要擅自把人家的女儿叫“都子”！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAm I only digging new holes for myself?!\d%K%P
「抱歉抱歉！？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dB-Besides... Toko's only a third-year student...!!\nI can't believe this... this is beyond anything I...\d%K%P
「而、而且小都子还是三年级学生吧！？\n竟然这样…做那种事…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry...\d%K%P
「对不起…」%K%P
It had been a while since I was so thoroughly hammered by\na large dose of common sense. I felt like my heart had\njust been pierced by a drill.%K%P
这很久没有听到过的正确得不能再正确的言论，\n仿佛锥子一样扎着我的心脏，都快要让其停止跳动了。%K%P
...That sounded pretty lethal, now that I thought about\nit.%K%P
…不，那可就麻烦了。活不了了。%K%P
