「我已经升学了啊。\n读上了秋泉大附的一年级了啊。\n…虽然妈妈“完全”不知道呢」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dN-N... Not to mention... from your appearance, you seem\nto be quite a bit older than Toko...\d%K%P
