Ms. Honoka's tone seemed to lose some of its former power\nafter having Toko point out her own misdeeds.%K%P
大概是被都子戳中痛点了，\n穗香小姐的口吻变得稍微慎重了些。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm 29... I'm in my twenties.\d%K%P
「２９岁…还是二十多岁的」%K%P
Only for another sixty days, though.%K%P
虽然这说法只剩６０天的短暂生命了。%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dY-You're in your thirties already?!\nAnd you actually want to date my daughter?!\d%K%P
「你、你这不是已经快３０岁了吗！？\n竟、竟然把和你年龄相差这么大的小都子给…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry...\d%K%P
「对不起…」%K%P
I was about ready to die from guilt, especially when the\nage issue was repeatedly brought up by none other but\nToko's real mother.%K%P
这事不论被重提多少次，产生的罪恶感都让我想要去死…\n而被都子的亲母亲指出，更让我无地自容。%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dAre you properly employed?\nPlease tell me at least you have a job.\d%K%P
