%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh.........?\d%K%P
「诶………？」%K%P
There was another... big discrepancy between us.%K%P
我们所掌握的情报好像不一致…又好像一致…%K%P
Ms. Honoka, the very person whose warmth and advice saved\nme from the pit of despair, the one who told me about this\nboarding house...%K%P
温柔地安慰了陷入绝望深渊的我，\n接受了我好几次的商谈，将公寓介绍给了我，\n说了『随时欢迎你来』的穗香小姐…%K%P
\dOh? Was he someone we knew?\d%K%P
『哎呀？我们认识吗？』%K%P
The person who gave me a warm cup of coffee in the middle\nof that freezing night, and the woman who provided me with\na glimmer of light in the midst of despair...%K%P
一年之前向我递来热咖啡的这个人，\n带给绝望的我一丝希望的这个人…%K%P
...was now looking at me with eyes filled with suspicion.%K%P
用有些发愣的表情，惊讶地注视着我。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理、君」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Ah...\d%K%P
「诶？啊…」%K%P
Toko, who had been observing the changes in my expression,\ncast a commiserating look at me.%K%P
都子看到这个表情，\n用很无语的表情从侧面看向了我。%K%P
But I gave that girl, over ten years my junior, a\nconfident smile.%K%P
但是我向这个比我小十多岁的女孩露出微笑，\n仿佛在说着『别担心』。%K%P
After all, I could separate my feelings from my memories.%K%P
因为现在的我，\n是能很好地将『回忆』和『思念』区别开来的。%K%P
I could say the name of the girl who meant the most to me\nin this world with no hesitation.%K%P
因为我能毫不犹豫地说出世界上自己最喜欢的人的名字了。%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dUm, now that I look at you... your face does look\nsomewhat familiar...\d%K%P
「那个…说起来，我好像在哪见过…？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, no, I'm sure you've never met him before! He's the\nman I've always wanted, and I found him all by myself! He\nhas nothing to do with you!\d%K%P
