%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dT-Toko?\d%K%P
「小、小都子？」%K%P
Toko, who had been averting her gaze until now, finally\ndecided to face Ms. Honoka with a resolute look.%K%P
刚才还在赌气别开脸的都子\n终于带着平静下来的视线转向了正面。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um, Toko... shouldn't we just...\d%K%P
「喂、喂，都子…今天就先…」%K%P
However, I couldn't decide if letting her say what she\nwanted was the correct choice in this situation.%K%P
然而对于现在想要把事情说出来的都子，\n她究竟是不是正确的，我无法判断。%K%P
As far as I knew, those two were a loving mother and\ndaughter up until Ms. Honoka disappeared last year.%K%P
在一年前，穗香小姐失踪那天以前，\n她们两人是名副其实的和睦母女。%K%P
Toko did everything in her power to protect the boarding\nhouse that held all those memories for her, hoping that\none day, she could live here with her mother again.%K%P
穗香小姐不在之后，都子拼命守护着公寓，\n为了看到『重新在一起生活的日子』，\n她在这一年里拼命努力了。%K%P
So I wasn't quite sure how to feel about the outsider who\ncame and prevented that dream from coming true.%K%P
在她的努力终于得到回报的这一天…\n本来的话，作为异类的我，\n将她们两人感动的再会给破坏了，大概的确是有什么不对劲吧。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo, I'll speak up.\nI can't remain silent when she keeps berating you like\nthat.\d%K%P
