%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm the only one allowed to lecture you, okay?!\d%K%P
「能叱责理君的人只有我一个！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOkay...\d%K%P
「是…」%K%P
There was no doubt in my mind that we were doing something\nwe shouldn't have when Ms. Honoka came back.%K%P
在穗香小姐回来的瞬间…\n我们毫无疑问是犯下了错误。%K%P
That kinda depended on one's perspective, though...%K%P
…感觉用日语表达很微妙…不过也的确是如此。%K%P
As such... I thought that having those two make up would\nbe a good first step towards mutual understanding.%K%P
既然如此…\n是不是要先从这对母女的和解打开突破口呢，\n倒也可以这么来思考。%K%P
I kept saying \dI thought\d over and over again.\nWas there actually anything I felt certain about?%K%P
…从刚才开始，我就不断在『思考』和『考虑』，\n不过也什么都没解决就是了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMom... why are you putting yourself on a pedestal,\ncomplaining about things that have nothing to do with\nyou?\d%K%P
