%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dE... Eh...?\d%K%P
「诶、诶诶…？」%K%P
Ms. Honoka was taken aback.%K%P
穗香小姐不知所措了…%K%P
It was probably the first time Toko talked back to her\nmother.%K%P
大概至今为止，\n她从未看到都子像这样来反抗吧。%K%P
That only reaffirmed in my mind just how tough this last\nyear was on her.%K%P
这么想来，母亲不在的这一年，\n都子是在怎样严苛的环境下生活的，真是让人刻骨铭心。%K%P
Although, it was partially my fault that Toko got so used\nto shouting at people...%K%P
…虽说都子有了这样反抗的胆量，\n总的说来，大概原因还是在于我吧。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
