%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um, Toko... I'm sure Ms. Honoka had her reasons as\nwell. You should listen to her side of the story before\njumping to conclusions.\d%K%P
「不、不，都子…穗香小姐也经历过很多事了吧，\n不闻不问的，就这么下定论也…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dToko! That man has tricked you!\d%K%P
「小都子！\n你、你被这个人骗了啊！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dDon't be ridiculous! If anyone's to blame for trickery\nhere, that'd be me. I made sure to woo him and make him\nmine, okay?!\d%K%P
「没那回事！诱骗的一方是我才对！\n因为，理君是我拼命追到手的啊！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dExcuse me?!\d%K%P
「喂！？」%K%P
Truth or not, I felt like the final remnants of my dignity\nas a man were crumbling right before my eyes.%K%P
这是不是事实暂且不说，\n但这也太让我这个男人没面子了…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou have no idea how hard it was! First there was Ms.\nKaya, then Himeo, and -then- he almost went back to Ms.\nKouno... Argh, remembering it just pisses me off all over\nagain!! Goddammit!!\d%K%P
「经历过很多辛苦的…对夏夜小姐犹豫过，\n对姬绪姐犹豫过，对老师也是摇摆不定………\n啊啊，想起来就火大！够了～，这都什么跟什么啊～！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I'm sorry?!\d%K%P
「对、对不起！？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dToko, this is wrong!\nYou're still too young for these things!\d%K%P
「不、不行的啊，小都子！\n你谈恋爱还为时尚早！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, it's too late for him!\nThis was the last chance for us, okay?!\d%K%P
「对理君来说就是太迟了啊！\n这次可是最后的机会了哦！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... don't think I want to agree with that.\d%K%P
「也不至于说到这个地步吧…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat? Are you still planning to look for other women?\d%K%P
「什么啊？你还想犹豫吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNot in the slightest!\d%K%P
「没有的事！？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dIn any case, I will never accept this!\nOpen your eyes, Toko!\d%K%P
「总之，我不认可！\n醒醒吧，小都子！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMaybe you should first try and reflect on everything you\ndid to me over the past year, Mom!!\d%K%P
「妈妈您才是！\n想想自己至今为止都做了些什么吧！」%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
\dEveryone, please wait!\nHonoka, you should calm down as well.\d%K%P
「各位请等一下！\n穗香小姐也冷静点…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「唔？」%K%P
It wasn't one of the eavesdropping tenants that suddenly\ninvaded the scene of our confrontation.%K%P
突然乱入到我们这修罗场（？）之中的，\n听上去并不是这里的住户。%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dH-Haruhiko...\d%K%P
「晴…晴彦先生…」%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
\dWhat on earth are you doing? I thought we agreed that you\nwould apologize to Mitoko first and foremost. How are you\ngoing to do that without having a proper conversation?\d%K%P
「这可不行啊…\n不是说好了要向美都子好好道歉的吗？\n首先得心平气和地谈一谈…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI-I'm sorry... I completely lost my cool...\d%K%P
「对、对不起…\n我也真是的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「呃？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
Ms. Honoka's attitude changed in the blink of an eye...%K%P
突然，穗香小姐的态度发生了一百八十度大转弯…%K%P
Now she seemed like a bashful maiden in love.%K%P
变得如少女般温顺了。%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
\dI knew I shouldn't have let you come here on your own.\nUm, Honoka deeply regrets everything that transpired here.\nPlease, do give her another chance.\d%K%P
「果然不该让你一个人去啊…\n穗香小姐真的是从心底里感到后悔。\n希望你们能明白这一点」%K%P
A young man appeared out of nowhere, promptly embracing\nMs. Honoka's shoulders.%K%P
出现在我们面前\n现在正搂着穗香小姐肩的青年…%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
\dAh, so you must be Mitoko.\d%K%P
「啊，你就是美都子吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh? Y-Yeah...\d%K%P
「诶？哈、哈啊…」%K%P
No matter how I looked at him, he seemed significantly\nyounger than Ms. Honoka... and me, for that matter...%K%P
他明显比穗香小姐年轻。\n不，何止如此，搞不好比我还要…%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
\dI'm sorry for barging in without prior notice.\nMy name is Nishiguchi Haruhiko, and I'm Ms. Honoka's...\nfiance.\d%K%P
「突然来打扰，真的非常抱歉。\n我叫西口晴彦。是穂香小姐的…未婚夫」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCEveryone
%LC全员
\dEeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeh?!\d%K%P
「诶诶诶诶诶诶诶诶～～～！？」%K%P
And so, putting aside that whole age difference debacle...%K%P
于是，嘛，把年龄的事先放一边…%K%P
The spring breeze sweeping across the Terrace House\nHinosaka...%K%P
Terrace House阳之坂突如其来的这阵风…%K%P
...would once again turn our lives upside down.%K%P
在这春日将逝之时，又将我们的命运\n吹到不知何处去了。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTw... Twenty-seven?!\d%K%P
「二………二十七！？」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dHaha... Yeah, I get that a lot. I've always had a\nsomewhat boyish face, you see.\d%K%P
「呀啊…我生来就是一副娃娃脸，经常让人很吃惊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, I'm sorry...\nThat's not what surprised me.\d%K%P
「啊，不好意思…\n让我吃惊的地方不是那里」%K%P
He was younger than me...%K%P
比、比我还小…%K%P
This guy was the fiance of Toko's mother?%K%P
穗香小姐的…\n都子母亲的、未婚夫…？%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dAh, I see... Is it because I'm quite a bit younger than\nHonoka?\d%K%P
「啊，这样啊…\n是因为和穗香小姐的年龄差距吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell... um...\d%K%P
「算、算是吧…」%K%P
Well, I did try proposing to Ms. Honoka at one point... So\nwith that in mind, he was likely a far better match for\nher than me.%K%P
不过话说回来，我以前也对穗香小姐…考虑到这一点，\n他们还算是非常正常的组合吧。%K%P
...After all, they were both proper adults.%K%P
…毕竟他们两人都是成年人了。%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dI myself was shocked when I learned of her age.\nIt's even more difficult to believe than in my case.\d%K%P
「我一开始知道她的年龄的时候，真是吓了一跳啊。\n她的年龄比我的更加难以猜透呢」%K%P
Mr. Nishiguchi made a troubled smile.%K%P
这西口氏一边说着，一边爽朗地笑着。%K%P
Well, I myself thought that we were either around the same\nage, or that she was two or three years older than me at\nworst.%K%P
嘛，记得我最开始也只是觉得\n她最多和我相差２～３岁的样子。%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dWhat's more, she actually hid the fact that she had a\ngrown daughter up until I proposed to her.\d%K%P
「而且，她竟然有这么大的一个女儿了。\n…在我提出要和她结婚之前，她都一直瞒着我呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIs Toko really that... grown?\d%K%P
「都子她…很大吗？」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dOf course. ...No matter how you look at her, she's an\nadult.\d%K%P
「嗯，那当然。\n…我觉得她已经是个很有思想的小姐了」%K%P
I knew I was supposed to question him about his\nrelationship and history with Ms. Honoka, but...%K%P
其实话题本来应该引向\n他和穗香小姐如何相识相爱上的。%K%P
...his random comment soothed my anguished heart.%K%P
然而他这若无其事地说出来的一句话，\n让我感觉自己似乎抓住了什么救命稻草。%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dThat's why you treat her like an adult yourself, correct?\nI almost grew jealous just looking at you two.\d%K%P
「所以你也是，\n把她当作一个成年女性来看待的吧？\n你们两人的关系，看着就让人羡慕不已啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dO-Oh, I...\nUm, I think you two are a good match as well...\d%K%P
「哪、哪里…你们才是…\n那个，挺合适的…」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dAhaha... Thank you very much.\nLooks like I gained the acceptance of the boyfriend. A\ngood start, all things considered.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈…非常感谢。\n总之，已经得到女儿男朋友的认可了吧」%K%P
I somehow felt more awkward than usual today.%K%P
总感觉现在我比以往还要逊啊。%K%P
Being polite and amiable was about my only positive trait,\nso having it so completely overshadowed by this man's\ntalent for socializing made me feel like I'd been robbed\nof my very reason of existence.%K%P
明明我自认为自己比别人优秀的地方也只有待人接物方面了，\n但在这一点上，现在我真感觉自己落后于眼前这个人了，\n我的存在意义究竟何在…%K%P
I wondered what Toko could possibly see in someone like\nme.%K%P
都子她…为什么会喜欢上我啊？%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dThat said, it seems like it'll take a while for me to get\non Mitoko's good side. Well, that just means I'll have to\ntry harder.\d%K%P
「不过，要解开和美都子的隔阂，\n似乎还要花一些时间。\n嘛，我会慢慢努力的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um... I'm sure it's going to be okay.\nYou have nothing to worry about.\d%K%P
「那、那个…一定没问题的。\n请别担心」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dYou really think so? From my perspective, it looks rather\nlike Mitoko is quite averse to the idea of letting another\nman into her life.\d%K%P
「是吗？\n不过我感觉美都子好像不想对除你以外的男性打开心扉」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's not true. Toko can be a little stubborn at times,\nbut you'd be hard-pressed to find a more kind-hearted girl\nin the entire world.\d%K%P
「没有的事。\n都子的确有点不好应付，\n但是，那样的好女儿，在世界上打着灯笼都找不到啊」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dMr. Yoshimura...\d%K%P
「芳村先生…」%K%P
I voiced an opinion clouded neither by blind infatuation\nnor parental attachment; the kind of evaluation you'd get\nwhen thinking about this whole thing objectively.%K%P
这既不是炫耀恋情，也不是出于父亲的自豪。\n我觉得这是冷静评价而得出的妥当结论。%K%P
Not like I could really look at Toko objectively.%K%P
嘛，这也不是能够冷静去评价的事啦。%K%P
Still, she did have at least one almost lethal flaw --\nhaving terrible taste in men.%K%P
而且，她喜欢上了我，\n也有这种致命的缺点来掩人耳目就是了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDespite what she said to Ms. Honoka, Toko's actually been\nwaiting for her to come back. There's not a person in the\nworld who wishes for Ms. Honoka's happiness more than\nher.\d%K%P
「虽然她对穗香小姐说了那样的话，\n但其实她一直都在等着母亲的归来。\n穗香小姐的幸福，她比任何人都要期盼」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...I'll be sure to tell her that.\d%K%P
「…我会把这些传达给她的」%K%P
I was one hundred percent confident in that, at least.%K%P
我是十分确信谁会说出怎样的话的。%K%P
If Toko was forced to choose between me and Ms. Honoka, I\nwas sure she would refuse to compromise and choose both of\nus.%K%P
都子的话，如果被迫要『在穗香小姐和我之间做出选择』，\n她一定会回答『谁都要』的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo... if you really are a man who can make Ms. Honoka\nhappy, then I'm sure Toko will accept you sooner or\nlater.\d%K%P
「所以…如果你真的能带给穗香小姐幸福的话，\n都子一定会认可你的」%K%P
No matter how much value Toko put into the one year she\nspent with me, there was no way it could overshadow all\nthe happy memories she and her mother shared.%K%P
无论在这一年里我给都子多么大的影响，\n她与穗香小姐十多年的回忆也不可能输给那些的吧。%K%P
She would always talk about Ms. Honoka with a smile on her\nface. Despite how miserable their parting was, Toko's\nfeelings didn't waver in the slightest.%K%P
都子谈到穗香小姐时，总是很开心的样子。\n明明经历了如此悲伤的告别，但思念从没有动摇过。%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dI do truly appreciate your words.\nThank you, Mr. Yoshimura.\d%K%P
「你这么一说，\n真的给了我勇气。\n…谢谢你，芳村先生」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, thank -you-.\nUm, for being considerate and everything...\d%K%P
「哪里，我才是…\n那个，各方面都让你费心了…」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dAhahahaha... It wasn't the most appropriately timed\nhomecoming, though.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈哈哈…似乎是时机有点不对呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm beyond ashamed.\d%K%P
「真没面子…」%K%P
If there was a parent who didn't completely lose it in\nthat situation, I would've loved to meet them.%K%P
看到那样的场景，\n如果有不会因此而发怒的父母，我倒是想见见。我真蠢啊。%K%P
If I were in Ms. Honoka's shoes, I would've flung myself\nat the guy in question to strangle him right then and\nthere... and likely ended up in the hospital after the\nscuffle.%K%P
或者说，如果我自己处于穗香小姐的立场上，\n现在恐怕就是我要掐对方脖子结果被反杀这种下场了吧。%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dDon't worry. You can leave her to me.\nI'll make sure to convince her to change her mind.\d%K%P
「没事的。\n你们的事先交给我吧。\n我一定会在近期说服穗香小姐的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMr. Nishiguchi...\d%K%P
「西口先生…」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dHowever... I struggle to say this without sounding rude,\nbut it would probably be for the best if you did not\nreturn to the Terrace House Hinosaka for the day.\d%K%P
「只是…那个，非常不好意思…\n从今天开始，还请你尽量少回Terrace House阳之坂」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... suppose you're right.\d%K%P
「那个嘛…也只好如此了」%K%P
It would have been impossible to spend any time at a\nboarding house that small without running into Ms. Honoka\nat least a few times.%K%P
那种房东和租户之间没有门槛的公寓，\n想要不和穗香小姐打面照是不可能的。%K%P
Well, I was already used to spending nights at the company\nbuilding, so that wasn't too much of a problem...\nAlthough, the company itself seemed to have begun viewing\nit as such lately.%K%P
不过我也习惯住在公司了，倒也没什么问题。\n…虽然对公司这一方来说，我也认识到这是个问题了。%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dI'm truly sorry about this! In any case, I'll first need\nto have a conversation with Ms. Honoka. I'll make sure\nyou're allowed back in before the end of the month!\d%K%P
「非常抱歉！\n总之我会先和穗香小姐谈谈的。\n一定让你在这个月内能够回来！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh, there's really no need for apologies. I was never\nsupposed to have forced this role on you in the first\nplace.\d%K%P
「不，那个…不用道歉的。\n这种事都要拜托你，\n本来就感觉不太妥」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dWhat else is there to do, though? Ms. Honoka is unable to\nthink straight at the moment. ...I sincerely doubt anyone\nelse could get through to her right now.\d%K%P
「这也是没办法的啊。\n穗香小姐现在处于无法冷静判断的状态。\n…找她谈，没有比我更合适的人了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm in your debt.\nAnd, um, good luck with Toko.\d%K%P
「拜托你了…\n还有…都子也是」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dI can deliver her a message if you want.\d%K%P
「有什么要传达的事，我可以帮你转告哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...No need.\nIn any case, I'm leaving this in your hands.\d%K%P
「…不，还是算了。\n拜托你了」%K%P
I was scared to imagine how Toko would react if she heard\nwords \dI love you\d from the words of someone else... even\nif that was only a message from me.%K%P
就算是知道是我所说的话，\n但如果从别人的口中听到『我爱你』，\n都子会有怎样的反应，想想就有点可怕…%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dI'm rooting for you, Mr. Yoshimura. Our positions may be\ndifferent, but we both have age gap issues to tackle in\nour relationships!\d%K%P
「我也会支援你的，芳村先生。\n虽说立场不同，但我们这两对都是年龄相差很大的情侣啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I truly appreciate your support, Mr. Nishiguchi!\d%K%P
「…谢谢你，西口先生！」%K%P
Thank goodness Ms. Honoka's fiance was such a good man.%K%P
太好了…\n穗香小姐的再婚对象是个好人，真是太好了。%K%P
My shared life with Toko was not yet without any glimmer\nof hope, or so it seemed.%K%P
我和都子的命运，\n依然还残留着如此大的希望。%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dLet us both do our best! Till the day you can finally\ncall me \dfather\d!\d%K%P
「为了你叫我『岳父』的那一天的到来，\n我们一起努力吧！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Um, I would rather not even imagine a scenario like\nthat.\d%K%P
「…不，让我去做那个畅想，您还是饶了我吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dTw... Twenty-seven?!\d%K%P
「二………二十七！？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dYes, he's a little younger than me.\d%K%P
「嗯…年龄“稍微”比我小」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
%XS10\dHe's younger than Osamu...\d %XE%K%P
「比理君还小啊…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dHaruhiko is very important to me. He pulled me up when I\nwas at my worst; he saved me from a pit of despair.\d%K%P
「晴彦先生啊…是我非常重要的人。\n他拯救了对人生感到绝望的我，是我的救命恩人」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSaved your life...?\nMom, don't tell me you were...\d%K%P
「救命…恩人？\n难、难道说，妈妈…？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI was a fool. Last year, I fled my home and left you\nbehind, thinking that I had to save one man.\d%K%P
「我…真是个笨蛋。\n一年前，我明明是以『这个人必须靠我来拯救』\n这个理由而把都子抛下离开家的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
%XS10\dOh boy, here we go again...\d %XE%K%P
「啊～，常有的事呢」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dIn the end, he was only interested in my money. Two\nmonths later, he found another woman and cast me aside\nlike a used tissue.\d%K%P
「结果，那个人只看中了我挣来的钱。\n连两个月都不到，就找了新的女人，把我抛弃了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd then you met this guy?\d%K%P
「然后，你就是那个时候遇到那个人的？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dNot really. I started working as a waitress at a nearby\nhot springs inn. I thought I'd have to first get some of\nmy money back before trying to apologize to you.\d%K%P
「不是，然后我就在附近的温泉旅馆做起了女招待。\n为了向小都子你道歉，\n我觉得要先赚到一些钱」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo he was one of the guests at that inn?\d%K%P
「他是那个旅馆的客人吗？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dNo, that was another man. He said he had a terminal\nillness and came to the inn for treatment. And so, we\nended up looking for his last resting place together.\d%K%P
「不是，那又是另一个男人。\n好像是因为得了不治之症而来接受温泉疗养的。\n然后，我们就想要两人殉情…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSeriously...\d%K%P
「喂～…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dBut then, he suddenly got a call from his wife and\nreturned home. It turns out all that stuff about his\nterminal illness was a lie, and he was just having a fight\nwith his wife.\d%K%P
「但那个人突然想要联系他的妻子了，\n于是就很干脆地回家了。\n…其实，他哪里是得了不治之症啊，只是和妻子吵架了而已」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd while you were still in shock from that, you met this\nguy?\d%K%P
「那，是那个人拯救了绝望中的您吗？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dNo, I started working at a nearby pub by the sea. The\nowner was a very nice person, and her husband, despite\nbeing a man of few words, was one of the most sincere\npeople I had ever met.\d%K%P
「不是，然后我就开始在海边小镇的小酒馆工作了。\n那里的老板娘是个很好的人。\n老板虽然言语不多，但也是个诚实的男性」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd this guy... He wasn't a customer at that place...\nright?\d%K%P
「不会是…那里的客人吧？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dTo tell the truth, those two had been distant for years,\nand...\d%K%P
「其实那位老板，已经好几年没有和妻子享受夫妻之欢了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAaaaaaargh! I have loads of trouble with stuff like that\nmyself! I'm willing to bet it's your genes to blame!\d%K%P
「啊啊啊啊啊！\n我如此的不含蓄全都是妈妈的错啊！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dAfter switching jobs three more times, I realized there\nwas no way I could show myself in front of you after\neverything I made you go through. And so, I began\naimlessly wandering the area of Tachimachi Cape...\d%K%P
「…然后，那之后我来回折腾又换了三次工作地，\n感觉自己已经没脸见小都子了，\n于是就稀里糊涂地走到了立待岬…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou went all the way to Hokkaido?\d%K%P
「都到北海道了…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI thought it was fate...\nI realized there was no other man for me but him...\d%K%P
「我觉得那就是命运啊…\n我已经只有那个人了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHow many times has that happened already?\d%K%P
「至今为止你多少次那样认为了啊…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dThis one is special! I mean, look, he finally made me\ncome back! He was the one who made it possible for us to\nmeet again!\d%K%P
「这次是肯定的。\n因为你看，他不是带着我回家了吗。\n他是让我见到了小都子的人哦？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, I suppose he seems semi-decent...\d%K%P
「嘛，看起来的确像个好人…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dHe works as a civil servant. He's originally from Tokyo,\nbut was actually on a business trip to Hakodate when we\nmet.\d%K%P
「他是公务员。本来是住在这边的，\n但正好在函馆出差的时候遇到了我…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dA civil servant? Guess he's never been laid off, then.\d%K%P
「公务员啊。\n…那就是和失业无缘的呢」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dUm, Toko. Don't you think Nishiguchi is a nice surname?\d%K%P
「呐，小都子。\n西口，你不觉得是个好姓氏吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI don't. I already know what my next surname will be.\d%K%P
「不觉得。\n接替“阳坂”的姓氏是要由我来决定的…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dToko...\d%K%P
「小都子…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBesides, I haven't made up with you, Mom. I'm not even\ngoing to consider forgiving you until you acknowledge\nOsamu.\d%K%P
「再说了，我和妈妈还没有重归于好吧？\n在您认可理君之前，我是绝对不会原谅您的！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI admit that I may have said too much, but still...\nIt's entirely too early for you...!\d%K%P
「刚刚妈妈的确也有说得太过的地方。\n但是，那种事果然还是不行的。\n小都子，你还…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat doesn't matter. You're no different -- you stop\ncaring about anything else when you find a man to love.\d%K%P
「与那个没有关系嘛。\n妈妈您不也是，遇到喜欢的人，就完全不顾后果了…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI'd like you to wait at least five more years. If your\nfeelings remain the same in adulthood, then you can start\nproperly dating him.\d%K%P
「至少再等个５年吧。\n等小都子成年了，那个时候心意依然没有改变的话，\n重新再交往不也挺好的？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dFive years again...?!\nHow many times do I have to listen to this crap?!\d%K%P
「还要等５年…？\n您要再这样回来几次才满足啊…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI will never leave you again. I'll raise you alongside\nHaruhiko with more care than ever before. There's no need\nfor you to rush anymore.\d%K%P
「我不会再离开了。\n会永远和晴彦先生一起养育小都子的。\n所以…已经没什么好慌张的了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo way... Just no. I mean...\nThere's no guarantee Osamu will wait that long for me.\d%K%P
「不要…我不要。因为啊，\n理君也不一定能一直等着我啊…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dFive years is nothing in the face of true love.\nAt least that's how I see it.\d%K%P
「如果他是真的爱你的话，\n妈妈觉得５年的时间他会等下去的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThere you go again, trying to hide behind some made-up\nadult logic whenever things are inconvenient for you...\nYou're just so... so...\d%K%P
「只是这种时候就要用大人的道理来打马虎眼…\n妈妈真是，妈妈真是…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dAnyway, we should go to sleep. Say, why don't we share a\nbed like we used to? It's been a while.\d%K%P
「好了，睡觉吧？\n…好久没有一起睡了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI've told you -- we're not making up until you\nacknowledge Osamu.\d%K%P
「我说过了吧？\n在您认可理君之前，我是不会和您重归于好的」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...I see.\d%K%P
「…是么」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dIn that case, goodnight.\d%K%P
「那么，晚安」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...You're not sleeping?\d%K%P
「…睡不着吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dDo you want me to sing a lullaby?\d%K%P
「摇篮曲…要我唱给你听吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...!!\d%K%P
「～～～！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dHaha... hahaha...\nToko... I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...\d%K%P
「呵呵…呵呵呵…\n小都子…抱歉、抱歉啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dKhh... fwhh... fwahh...\nMom... Mom... you really are... so...\d%K%P
「呵…呼、呼啊啊…\n妈妈、妈妈…真的、真的是…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI'm sorry for being such a terrible mother.\nBut I'll make you happy this time. I promise.\d%K%P
「原谅我这个散漫的妈妈好吗…？\n这次…这次一定会幸福起来的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUeeeeeeeh...\nN-No... no... I... I...\d%K%P
「呜呜呜呜呜，不、不行，不行啊…\n我、我…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dCome by here, my Lord, come by here♪\nCome by here, my Lord, come by here♪\d%K%P
「♪～♪♪～♪、♪♪～♪～♪～\n♪♪～♪～♪～♪～」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUaaaaaaah... ah... hkhh...\nMom... ah... hkhh... uah, uah...\d%K%P
「呜啊啊啊啊啊…啊…呜…\n妈妈…啊…呜呜…呜、呜呜…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dEverything's going to be just fine.\nMom will look after you from now on.\d%K%P
「什么也别担心好吗…？\n从今以后，妈妈会保护你的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHkh, uah, uahh...!\d%K%P
「呜、呜、呜呜…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dGoodnight... Toko.\d%K%P
「晚安…小都子」%K%P
.........%K%P
………%K%P
......%K%P
……%K%P
...%K%P
…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnd you got kicked out?\nYou two actually thrive on drama, don't you?\d%K%P
「于是你又被赶出来了？\n真是的，你们这一路走来还真是波澜万丈啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wasn't kicked out.\nThey just wanted some time alone as a family.\d%K%P
「没有被赶出来啦。\n只是家人间的谈话需要一些时间」%K%P
The day after I made a tactical retreat from the Terrace\nHouse Hinosaka...%K%P
从Terrace House阳之坂战术性撤退的第二天。%K%P
...I received one of Asami's random phone calls, and told\nher everything that had transpired over a dinner at\nShanzeriya.%K%P
我依然是被心血来潮的麻实的电话叫了出来，\n在香泽里拉一边吃着饭，一边交谈着最近发生的事。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell, they can say whatever they want, but you've signed\nthe lease. You could've forced them to let you stay.\d%K%P
「话是这么说，\n但你毕竟有租赁协议，\n完全是可以赖着不走的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThere's no way I could've done something like that...\nIt would've been the end of us.\d%K%P
「不可能那么去做吧…\n如果那么去做，我们就结束了」%K%P
After our dinner -- just as I was about to head back to\nthe company -- Asami asked me if I wanted to walk with her\nfor a short while. And so here we were, on this late night\nstroll.%K%P
那之后，准备回公司的我，\n受到麻实『稍微走走吧？』的邀请，\n于是就这么在夜晚散起步来。%K%P
The moon -- only slightly less full than it was yesterday\n-- illuminated our path with its silvery light.%K%P
今天的月亮没有前天那么圆满，\n但依然明亮地照着我们的道路。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHahh...\nYou must have really made bedfellows with misfortune,\nOsamu.\d%K%P
「哈啊…你啊，\n真是被穷神缠上身了啊，理」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd I'll stay like that until I've paid my dues and it\ntransforms into fortune. Just you watch, I'll become the\nhappiest man alive soon enough.\d%K%P
「在变身为福神之前还会一直在一起的。\n你瞧好了，我很快就会变得比任何人都幸福的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Pure bliss was within my reach, and I'd already tasted it\ntwo days ago.%K%P
对我来说最大的幸福，\n的确在两天之前还摆在我面前。%K%P
A few mishaps along the way sent it drifting farther from\nmy grasp, but this was now merely a question of time. I\nfelt confident that in a few days, we'd be right back\nwhere we left off.%K%P
虽然现在面前遇到一点点阻碍，\n但过不了几天，\n我们前进的路应该就会疏通了。%K%P
...Or at least I wanted that to be the case.%K%P
…现在我必须这么相信。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'll drop by and visit Ms. Hinosaka myself sometime soon.\nI should probably explain all the hoops we had to jump\nthrough to get Mitoko accepted into her new school.\d%K%P
「我再去一次阳坂家吧。\n关于她升学时候的一些复杂事，\n还是由我来说明比较好」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThanks, Asami. I don't think she'd want to meet me right\nnow.\d%K%P
「现在你能来见我，\n真是帮大忙了，麻实」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm her homeroom teacher. ...Former homeroom teacher, at\nany rate.\nI wonder if Mitoko will get suspicious about us again.\d%K%P
「我毕竟是她的班主任嘛。\n…虽然是原班主任就是了。\n也许美都子还挺不乐意的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe won't. Toko's grateful to you from the bottom of her\nheart. She just can't say it out loud because of\neverything that happened.\d%K%P
「没那回事的。\n都子是真心感谢麻实你的。\n只是因为发生了很多事，嘴上说不出来」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI hope you're right...\d%K%P
「如果真是这样，那就好了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat aside... where are we right now?\d%K%P
「那倒是…话说这里是哪啊？」%K%P
The two of us were walking through a town unknown to me.%K%P
我们两人漫步在这我所不知道的大街上。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see... Normally, we used to always come from the\nopposite direction. Must be why you've yet to realize\nwhere we are.\d%K%P
「这样啊…\n平时走的都是与此相反的方向，\n没察觉到这是哪啊」%K%P
We were quite a way from the station already. If I didn't\nfollow her lead, I'd be sure to get lost.%K%P
在这离车站很远的地方，\n我迷失了方向，已经不得不跟着麻实走了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Is this a place I should be familiar with?\nHave we been here before?\d%K%P
「…也就是说，这是我知道的地方？\n之前我们两人来过…？」%K%P
Her words sent an inexplicable tinge of nostalgia across\nmy heart, despite this being a completely new area to\nme... As far as I knew, at least.%K%P
这不熟悉的地带莫名其妙地引起了我的怀念之情…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu.\d%K%P
「呐，理」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
Before I knew it, her face was right in front of my eyes.%K%P
不知什么时候，麻实的脸出现在了我的面前。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWe're here.\n...I live in Room #102 of this building.\d%K%P
「到了哦。\n…这里的１０２号房」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
So this was Asami's new apartment...%K%P
这样啊，这里是…\n麻实的公寓。%K%P
We got off the train on a different station so I didn't\nrealize we were actually heading to the same area from the\nopposite side.%K%P
与平时下车的站相隔一站下的车，\n所以我完全没有察觉到是走在这个方向上的。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou'll have a cup of tea, won't you?\d%K%P
「茶…进去喝一杯吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBesides, I don't charge rent for sleepovers.\nYou could stay here until things calm down.\d%K%P
「顺带一提…只是睡觉的话，可以免费哦？\n在事情平息下来之前，住到什么时候都是可以的哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dL-Look, Asami... I think that's going a bit too far.\d%K%P
「喂、喂，麻实…\n再怎么说这也…」%K%P
Asami treated me like she always did.%K%P
麻实的态度，\n与过去相比几乎没怎么变。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dListen, Osamu... What are you planning to do about having\na place to live?\d%K%P
「理你打算住在哪里啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMy company has a comfortable napping room.\nI suppose weekly apartments are an option, too.\d%K%P
「公司有休息室。\n还有每周公寓什么的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou can't waste money like that.\nI mean, you don't really have any savings left, do you?\d%K%P
「不行的，那样太浪费了。\n你完全没有储蓄吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell... that's true, but...\d%K%P
「那种事…的确如此就是了」%K%P
That usual behavior of hers made me feel grateful, but it\nalso filled me with pain...%K%P
她的『一如既往』是如此令人感激，同时也令人辛酸…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThen it's decided. They say you can't hesitate to help a\nfriend in need. So with that said, do come in.\d%K%P
「那不就得了。\n嘛，不是说过有困难的时候就要互相帮助的吗。\n来吧，欢迎～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um... look... I think I'll go.\d%K%P
「不、不，所以说…我还是回去吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhy?\d%K%P
「为什么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI mean... I already have...\d%K%P
「所、所以说，我已经…」%K%P
I had Toko.%K%P
有都子了…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...What on earth are you thinking, Osamu?\d%K%P
「…你是不是误会什么了啊，理？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-What do you mean?\d%K%P
「误、误会？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDid something unusual happen when I stayed in your room\nfor a whole month?\d%K%P
「我在你的家里住的一个月期间，\n发生过什么特别的事吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, not really...\d%K%P
「啊，不…」%K%P
Even back when I couldn't even move on my own, Asami\nmaintained her self-restraint.%K%P
那个时候，我还并不自由，\n麻实也被自责所折磨…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou know, it kinda makes me sad to see you so distant\nafter you claimed to be my friend...\d%K%P
「一面说着我是你的知己，\n一面又和我拉开这样的距离，我有点伤心了～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA friend...\d%K%P
「知己…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI don't want you to think that you used to be married to\nsomeone who'd abandon a friend in need.\d%K%P
「对有困难的知己不闻不问的薄情家伙，\n以及被认为是过去结过婚的，你讨厌吧？」%K%P
Asami had accepted the new kind of relationship I half-\nforced on her.%K%P
由我一手推铸成的新关系，\n麻实接受了。%K%P
