I most certainly did not expect for the cafe to be out of\nempty seats, and I didn't have the guts to turn those two\ndown.%K%P
不，因为…\n我已经混乱到不知道是和他们同坐一桌的了，\n他们也没有让我们生气到就此拒绝的程度。%K%P
...They probably didn't want to just leave without saying\na word. It would've been awkward for them, too.%K%P
…而我觉得自己也没有惹对面的人生气到\n让他们什么也不说立马走人的程度吧。%K%P
