%LC伦子
\dMatsuru has already found a new boyfriend. I got a text\nfrom her saying they joined the Literature Club just the\nother day.\d%K%P
「真鹤她很快就交到新的男朋友了哦？\n之前她发来邮件说他们一起加入了文艺部」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat?! It only took her a month to get over it?!\nAnd now she's after a studious-sounding guy?!\d%K%P
