%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dIf anything, giving up when you realize your feelings\nhave no future is an admirable trait to have. A certain\nsomeone I know could learn from her, instead of being\nmentally obsessed.\d%K%P
「知道那是无法得到回报的恋爱，当然有必要放弃。\n不像某个人一样纠缠不休，\n把大家踢散，只顾着自己的幸福」%K%P
