「这也是为了房东妹妹啊。\n那孩子，明明还处于向父母撒娇的年龄，\n却受了这么多的苦」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dHonoka would do anything to change the past.\nIf only Mitoko understood how deeply she feels about\nher...\d%K%P
