「我也是大人了啊。\n都已经能生孩子了…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI don't want to be a grandma at my age...\d%K%P
「我可是非常不想成为姥姥的啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBesides, I can handle myself better than you, Mom.\nI'm way better at making a man happy...!\d%K%P
「而且…\n我比妈妈更可靠啊。\n如果是我的话，是能够和男人获得幸福的…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dUagh...!\d%K%P
「呜…咕…！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...I'm sorry. I've said too much.\nI'm sorry... but I think it's the truth.\d%K%P
「…抱歉，说得太过了。\n不过，虽然很抱歉，但我觉得这是事实」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dYou never said things like that to me before...\d%K%P
「以前的小都子明明是不会说出这种话的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm sorry... but last year was really special for me.\nIt was the longest year in my entire life, you could say.\d%K%P
「抱歉，抱歉啊…\n但对我来说，去年是特别的。\n在我有生以来，那是最长的一年」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dThat's... my fault, isn't it?\d%K%P
「这…果然是我的错吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYes, but I'm also grateful to you. I ended up meeting\nOsamu both because you were there, and because you\nweren't.\d%K%P
「这都是托妈妈的福啊…\n正因为有妈妈…\n而且妈妈不见了，我才能理君相遇」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dToko...\d%K%P
「小都子…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI know it makes no sense to thank you, but I was really\nhappy when a certain tall gentleman appeared at my\ndoorstep out of nowhere.\d%K%P
「我也知道，如果为此感谢的话在各种意义上都不对劲…\n不过我真的很开心。\n是您让那个高个子大叔出现在了我的面前」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUgh, look at me, rambling about all this sappy nonsense.\nSorry. I doubt you wanna hear that kinda stuff right now.\d%K%P
「…话题变得沉重了啊。\n抱歉，这种事在吃饭的时候说可不怎么好」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dNo, that's not the case...\d%K%P
「不，没那回事的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnyway, time to eat. I'm actually quite confident in this\ndish. Picked up that flatfish for extra cheap, too.\d%K%P
「来，吃吧。\n今天的炖菜，是我的自信之作。\n食材也便宜起来了」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWith all the introductions out of the way, let's dig--\d%K%P
「那么重新说一遍，我开动了～…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dToko.\d%K%P
「小都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dDo you truly feel this strongly about that man?\nAre you absolutely sure you won't regret it later on?\d%K%P
「你就是这么喜欢那个人吗？\n『果然是搞错了』不会这样后悔的自信，你有吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMom... What's that supposed to mean...?\d%K%P
「妈妈…您这是什么意思…？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dAnswer my question.\nI'm being serious.\d%K%P
「好好回答。\n妈妈是认真在问的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI spent too much time wallowing in regret. I tried giving\nup on him so many times, and all it ever did was make me\ncry even more.\d%K%P
「要说后悔的话…我早就后悔过很多次了。\n好几次都想要对理君死心了，\n每次那样的时候，我就伤心得不得了…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's the conclusion I came to after months of nigh-\nunbearable suffering.\d%K%P
「『好几次』『好几次』『每次那样的时候』…\n这是我纠结了又纠结后的结论，\n以至于脑子里也只能想出这些措辞了」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI love Osamu. I'm madly in love with him.\n...He was extremely troubled when I first told him.\d%K%P
「我喜欢理君。喜欢极了。我爱他。\n…不过我最开始这么说的时候，理君也感到非常困扰」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI see...\d%K%P
「是么…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dGeez... Do you get a kick out of picking on me?\nWhat do you get out of making me cry...?\d%K%P
「讨厌啦，真是的…\n妈妈，欺负我就是这么有趣吗？\n把我弄哭，对妈妈您有什么好处啊…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dYes. Perhaps I stand to gain nothing from this.\n...After all, that's not the only big thing weighing on my\nmind.\d%K%P
「是啊。也许对我什么好处也没有。\n…毕竟这就已经让我烦恼不已了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...?\d%K%P
「…？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI'll... consider it.\nI'll try meeting your friend one more time.\d%K%P
「我…稍微考虑一下吧。\n再去见一见小都子的男朋友」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dNow that I think about it... the last time we spoke, I\nspent the entire time being angry at him and refused to\nlisten to a word he said.\d%K%P
「仔细想想，一直都是我这边单方面的生气，\n还没有好好和他谈谈」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dM... Mom?\d%K%P
「妈…妈妈？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI mean, you're better at looking after yourself than me.\nAnd if you're willing to vouch for him, then I suppose I\nshouldn't jump to any conclusions before hearing him out.\d%K%P
「比我要可靠多的小都子，\n能喜欢他到这种程度。\n不面对面谈谈的话，什么也不好说的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMom... Are you serious?\nAre you really going to talk to him?\d%K%P
「妈妈…真的吗？\n您真的要和理君谈谈？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dYes. I promise. Say, why don't the four of us have dinner\ntogether on our next day off?\d%K%P
「嗯…我保证。\n下次的假期，我们四人吃个饭，聊一聊可以吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dS-Sure! Let's do that!\nPlease give us another chance!\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯、嗯！\n拜托了，拜托您了！\n请再给我和理君一次机会吧！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dKyah?! Geez, Toko... What are you doing in the middle of\nlunch?\d%K%P
「呀？\n等、等等，小都子…\n你这孩子啊，现在在吃饭…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm just so happy... I love you, Mom!\d%K%P
「好开心…妈妈，最喜欢您了！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dWell... that's one thing I haven't heard in a while.\d%K%P
「嘛…感觉好久没听过这话了呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI love you! You're the best! I love how easy you are to\ninfluence! You're almost like Ms. Kouno in that regard!\d%K%P
「真的、真的最喜欢您了！\n容易随波逐流的妈妈，我最喜欢了！\n就像香野老师一样！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dToko... I can see just how much this last year meant to\nyou.\d%K%P
「…小都子。\n去年对你来说，\n果然是非常特别的啊」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dThat Nishiguchi...\nI don't know why, but he reminds me of Laid-off.\d%K%P
「那个叫西口的男人…\n总让人想起失业的啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dIndeed...\nWhich means the Young Mistress is unable to treat him with\ndisdain.\d%K%P
「的确…\n那样的话，小房东是无法对他冷淡的吧」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dAnd unlike Laid-off, he has a proper job as a civil\nservant.\d%K%P
「而且他和失业的又不同，\n有公务员这种正经的工作」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dA tad lacking in years, but he seems to be a man able to\nstand on his own two feet. What's more, he seems so madly\nin love with our proprietress that there's no danger of\nhim shifting his attention to her daughter.\d%K%P
「虽然年轻了点，但很靠得住，\n最重要的是，他被老板娘迷住了，\n不用担心女儿会遭到他的毒手」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dLaid-off was originally in love with Ms. Landlord,\nthough.\d%K%P
「失业的一开始也是被房东小姐迷住了啊…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dW-Well... leaving that aside, the world these days lacks\nin genuinely kind-hearted people. They often end up being\ndeficient in some other regard, much like our own Young\nMaster.\d%K%P
「嘛、嘛，那个暂且不说，\n那种『普通的好人』最近不怎么有了吧？\n无论如何都是像小少爷那样的人，某个地方存在缺点」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dLike having a fetish for smooth, young skin.\d%K%P
「沉溺于幼小的光滑肌肤了啊…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...I'm trying to discuss Ms. Landlord's boyfriend right\nnow. Just how much do you two love the Young Master?\d%K%P
「…现在说的是房东小姐情夫的事啊。\n你们究竟是有多喜欢小少爷啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dGotta admit, that one's a rare breed.\nFirst time she brought a guy like that home.\d%K%P
「嘛，这的确是很稀有。\n是至今为止从未有过的类型」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dHe was the one who convinced the proprietress to come\nhome. Perhaps he really is a man worthy of our trust.\d%K%P
「好像老板娘也是被他说服的，\n说不定他意外的是个有气魄的人呢」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dAfter a storm comes a calm.\d%K%P
「这就是所谓的『不打不相识』吧」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dAnd so, this date marks the birth of two happy couples\nunder the roof of our Terrace House Hinosaka.\d%K%P
「于是Terrace House阳之坂\n诞生了两对幸福的情侣啊…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKihee & Yoshinori & Buntarou
%LC喜兵卫＆吉则＆文太郎
\dThere's no way it can all end like this.\d%K%P
「不可能就这样结束的吧」\n「不可能就这样结束的吧」\n「不可能就这样结束的吧」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI've gotta do everything all over again.\d%K%P
「重来…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry...\d%K%P
「总是总是抱歉了…」%K%P
One Sunday in late April.%K%P
４月下旬，星期日。%K%P
I was back in the now-familiar restaurant of the Triton\nHotel, reunited with my little lover after a week-long\nseparation.%K%P
在这最近感觉非常熟悉了的特里同酒店里，\n我与几乎一周没有见面的恋人面对面了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy are you so hopeless with ties?\nC'mon, be still.\d%K%P
「理君真的是\n对打领带太不擅长了。\n啊，别动」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, I've never been good with my hands...\nI-I'm really sorry...\d%K%P
「啊，这个是因为啊，我的手指尖不太好使…\n真、真是不好意思」%K%P
Next to Toko, who was currently busy with my neck, sat a\nbeautiful woman with features bearing a striking\nresemblance to hers.%K%P
在不辞辛劳关照着我的都子邻座，\n有一位面貌有些相似的美丽女性。%K%P
...Well, obviously it was Toko who took after her, and not\nthe other way around.%K%P
…当然指的是都子和她有些像啦。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThere, I'm done.\nYeah. You're looking good today, Osamu.\d%K%P
「好了。\n嗯，今天也很帅气哦，理君」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTh-Thanks, Toko.\d%K%P
「谢、谢谢你，都子」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
The seat seemed to be just at the right height for Toko to\ndo the job, so I remained sitting while she stood up and\nbegan fiddling with my neck.%K%P
我坐下来的高度正好和都子的身高差不多相同，\n所以都子站着重新为我打好了领带。%K%P
It was pretty surreal seeing her so excited next to a\nsomewhat glum-looking Ms. Honoka.%K%P
面对不辞辛劳的她，\n穗香小姐显出一丝不高兴的面孔，\n感觉像是在注视什么稀奇事似的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, Osamu... Let's go see a movie after dinner.\nIt's an adaptation of the game we used to play, remember?\d%K%P
「呐、呐，理君。\n吃完饭后去看电影吧？\n你看，上次大家一起玩的游戏出了真人版了」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...!\d%K%P
「…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWe can't do that, Toko.\nYou should go home with your mother for now.\d%K%P
「不行的，都子。\n今天还是老老实实回家吧」%K%P
She had to go and pick a weird movie like that...%K%P
而且游戏原作的真人版电影这种微妙的选择，\n在各种意义上我都不想去看。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHuh? But why? There's no need to worry. Mom has already\naccepted us.\d%K%P
「诶～，这有什么不好的。\n没问题的，妈妈会认可的。\n认可我们俩的事」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I wonder what's keeping Mr. Nishiguchi!\nI hope he didn't run into any trouble at work!\d%K%P
「好、好迟啊，西口先生！\n他工作似乎很忙」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dHe had a sudden phone call just as he was about to\nleave...\d%K%P
「出门之前突然被电话叫走了…」%K%P
Toko, in her euphoria, failed to notice how her comment\ninstantly worsened Ms. Honoka's mood.%K%P
正是都子的这句『没问题的』，\n让穗香小姐对我的印象恶化了，\n不过有点飘飘然了的都子似乎无法理解。%K%P
A few days ago, I got a call from the slightly overexcited\nToko, telling me about this appointment.%K%P
几天前，我接到了兴奋地喘着气的都子电话，\n说是预约今天要来聚餐吃顿饭。%K%P
Apparently, Mr. Nishiguchi had finally managed to convince\nMs. Honoka to meet and have a conversation with me.%K%P
一直拥护着我们的西口先生\n最终说服了穗香小姐，\n所以她才能来到今天的谈话餐桌旁。%K%P
Failure was not an option today. I had to use this\nopportunity to make Ms. Honoka acknowledge and let me back\ninto the Terrace House Hinosaka.%K%P
所以今天绝不能失败。\n得想尽一切办法让穗香小姐认可我和都子的事，\n为我回到Terrace House阳之坂打下基石…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, what will you have, Osamu?\nOh, I know. Let's order different desserts and share them\nwith each other.\d%K%P
「呐，要吃什么呢，理君？\n啊，各种甜点我都有点，要各自分一半哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCould you calm down a little?\d%K%P
「老老实实坐好…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
It didn't seem like Toko would provide me with any\nsupport, having already been convinced of our victory.%K%P
确信着已经取得胜利的都子还在做掩护射击，\n只有今天我一点也不期待。%K%P
In other words, I had to do what I always did -- treat the\nissue seriously and with honesty.%K%P
到头来，还是像以前那样，\n我只能尽力而为…\n也就是一本正经地去诉说。%K%P
\dToko and I are in a serious relationship.\d%K%P
『请让我和都子堂堂正正地交往』%K%P
\dWe love each other.\d%K%P
『我们真的是互相恋慕的』%K%P
\dWe are planning to eventually get married.\d%K%P
『我们是以结婚为前提交往的！』%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
No way...%K%P
不行了…%K%P
The more honestly I tried to think about it, the more\nguilty the whole affair made me feel.%K%P
越是认真、一本正经地去诉说，\n我心中的背德感就越是强烈。%K%P
To sum it up, I -- a thirty-year-old man -- was in a\nserious relationship with a girl over a decade my junior.\nIt just made me sound worse.%K%P
也就是说，我认真而一本正经地强调着\n３０岁的男人爱着比他小Ｎ多岁的学生，\n这种不堪入耳的事。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM... Mr. Nishiguchi sure is late...\d%K%P
「好…好迟啊，西口先生」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...If you're so worried about time, you're free to leave\nwhenever you wish.\d%K%P
「…你这么在意时间的话，\n要不今天就散了吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI am terribly sorry! I did not intend to suggest anything\nof the sort! Please believe me!\d%K%P
「非常抱歉！\n绝不是这种意思…绝不是！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMom... why do you keep being so hard on Osamu?\nYour boyfriend -is- kinda late.\d%K%P
「妈妈为什么要针对理君啊？\n本身就是他迟到了啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um, Toko... please...\d%K%P
「不、不，所以说都子…」%K%P
I wished she didn't keep taking my side here to that\nextent.%K%P
今天庇护我也要恰如其分地来啊…%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dToko... I'd instead like to know why you become so\nemotional and flustered whenever you're around this man.\d%K%P
「小都子…\n你才是，为什么在这个人面前\n就是一直飘飘然啊？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dW-Well... I mean... You've no idea how much I suffered\nuntil I finally managed to make him notice me.\d%K%P
「那、那是，那是啊…\n因为，在理君理睬我之前，\n我经历了怎样的辛酸…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPlease, let's not discuss that today...\d%K%P
「所以说，今天那种事…」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dI-I'm sorry for being late!\d%K%P
「对、对不起，我迟到了！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dHaruhiko...!\d%K%P
「晴彦先生…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI've been waiting for you, Mr. Nishiguchi!!\d%K%P
「我都快等得不耐烦了啊，西口先生！」%K%P
He had no idea just how grateful I was.\nIn my mind, I silently thanked him for saving me from that\nterrible situation...%K%P
不，这是实话。\n不过在这气氛里救了我，真的是非常感谢…%K%P
%LCHonoka
