\dIt was Mr. Nishiguchi.\d%K%P
「西口先生打来的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI see...\d%K%P
「是么…」%K%P
I was genuinely relieved it was him who picked up the\nreceiver.%K%P
其实，一听电话那头是他的声音，我就松了一大口气。%K%P
I felt like I might have caused another panic episode for\nMs. Honoka if I told her directly that Toko was with me.%K%P
要是直接向穗香小姐说出『现在都子在我这儿』这种话，\n那会引起怎样的恐慌啊…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHave you calmed down a little?\d%K%P
「稍微冷静些了吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah...\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThen let's have dinner.\nYou're hungry, aren't you?\d%K%P
「那，我们吃饭吧？\n都子饿了吧？」%K%P
I scooped some fried rice from the pot and placed it on\nToko's plate.%K%P
说完，我从中华锅里盛起炒饭，\n把盘子放到了都子面前。%K%P
It might have looked unshapely, but that was nothing\ncompared to how badly it must have tasted... so it was\nokay.%K%P
虽然表面看起来有些糟糕，\n不过和味道的糟糕程度比起来，也不是啥大事了，\n所以问题不大…%K%P
Well, maybe it really wasn't.%K%P
怎么可能。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNow that I think about it... This is going to be your\nfirst time eating something I made, right?\d%K%P
「说起来啊…\n至今为止，我还没做饭招待过你吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah... It's the first time I've seen you cook.\d%K%P
「嗯…\n我还是第一次看到理君做料理」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHow was it? Don't you think the apron suits me?\d%K%P
「怎样？\n我穿围裙的样子还挺有型的吧？」%K%P
I spun around, displaying the apron that only managed to\ncover my upper half.%K%P
说完，我保持着只有上半身穿着围裙的样子，\n原地转了一圈。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou look like a dork.\d%K%P
「真逊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dGh...\d%K%P
「唔…」%K%P
However, it didn't seem like Toko was impressed.%K%P
…然而，都子的评价却很糟糕。%K%P
Perhaps ten days were not quite enough for me to master\nthe art of wearing an apron.%K%P
开始做料理不过才１０天，\n这现状果然是不容乐观么。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell then, let's dig in! I tried making fried rice today!\nI even added a few vegetables... as you can see.\d%K%P
「算、算了，吃吃看吧！\n今天我试着做了炒饭！\n材料你看…放了一点进去了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah. I'll have some, then.\d%K%P
「嗯…我开动了」%K%P
Toko was somewhat unsettled by my appearance, but that\ndidn't particularly detract from her interest in my\ncooking. She scooped up some rice and slowly brought it to\nher mouth.%K%P
都子虽然在各方面沉重打击了我现在的打扮，\n但她似乎仍然对我做的料理颇感兴趣，\n用勺子舀了一点，慢慢送向口中。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNm...\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dH-How is it...?\d%K%P
「怎、怎样…？」%K%P
I could only hope that Toko was enough of an adult not to\nbreak my heart. Or that hunger was the best spice. Or that\nlove was blind... or in this case, without any taste buds.%K%P
这里就只能期待都子大人的回应了。\n或者『空腹是最好的调味品』啦，\n『麻子也会看成酒窝』啦。%K%P
...From now on, I would make the effort to improve.%K%P
………我还要继续修行啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Uh... uah... ah...\d%K%P
「…呜…呜、呜呜…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-What is it, Toko?\d%K%P
「怎、怎么了，都子？」%K%P
As soon as my fried rice entered her mouth, Toko covered\nit with her left hand and started crying.%K%P
都子把我的料理含入嘴里后，\n突然用左手捂住嘴，又哭了起来。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUh... uah... ueh... fwh, uah, uaaah...\d%K%P
「呜…呜呜…呜呜…呜、呜、呜啊啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA-Are you okay?\nSurely it wasn't bad enough to make you cry.\d%K%P
「没、没事吧？\n那个，难道说是难吃到哭了吗？」%K%P
It seemed as though her face had been contorted by a deep-\nrooted sorrow.%K%P
她的表情显得很悲伤，\n或者说是激动不已…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...It was, actually.\d%K%P
「………嗯」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh, really...\d%K%P
「啊～，这样啊」%K%P
But then it turned out it was just my cooking to blame.%K%P
然而，看来我做出来的果然是无法下喉的东西。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou haven't scattered the rice, and you just used a\nrandom amount of salt, didn't you? Not to mention nothing\nis mixed properly. The vegetables aren't properly boiled,\neither... It's inedible...\d%K%P
「米饭都没炒开。盐放得量不对。\n而且没有很好地混匀。蔬菜炒得也不够。\n净是些芯子啊、梗啊，根本没法吃…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh... I see...\d%K%P
「啊～～～，这样啊…」%K%P
She didn't need to go that far to hurt my feelings...%K%P
不过也用不着贬低到这种程度吧。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm sorry... I'm so sorry, Osamu...\nIt's my fault you have to live off of culinary disasters\nlike this...\d%K%P
「抱歉，抱歉啊，理君…\n因为我不在，过着这种寒酸的生活…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, um, it's not your fault.\nI used the shafts of the vegetables because I'm cheap,\nthat's all.\d%K%P
「啊，不，这不是都子的错。\n而且说到底，蔬菜净是芯和梗，\n那只是我节约而已…」%K%P
After all, I started cooking myself for economic reasons\nas well.%K%P
而且，自己做饭本来就是节约的一环。%K%P
Toko was actually the one who explained it to me how much\nmore economic it was to eat ten kilograms of rice a month\ncompared to having cup ramen every day.%K%P
比起每天吃方便面，\n一个月吃１０千克的米饭要经济得多，\n这是都子以前教导我的。%K%P
And if you visited the grocery store near the station just\nbefore closing time, they'd give you shafts and other old\nvegetables they couldn't sell for free.%K%P
于是我就在车站前的商店街的菜铺打烊的时候去那，\n免费得到像菜叶子和根的蔬菜渣。%K%P
I was spending less than ten thousand yen a month on food\nthese days.%K%P
我现在一个月的生活费控制在了一万日元之内…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIf only I could be with you... If I was there at your\nside, you'd never need to cook again... uah, ueeh... I'm\nsorry... I'm so sorry...!\d%K%P
「如果我在的话…我在理君身边的话，\n就不会让你去做料理的了…\n呜、呜呜…抱歉啊，抱歉啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, I think I'd want to handle some of the chores even if\nI lived with you.\d%K%P
「不，就算是和都子你在一起，\n我也还是要多少分担一些家务事…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWith me around, you could eat delicious meals every day!\nYou wouldn't need to torture yourself with this cat food!\d%K%P
「如果和我在一起的话，\n理君就能一直吃到好吃的料理了！\n就用不着吃这种猫粮一样的东西了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCat food, you say...\d%K%P
「猫啊」%K%P
She might have been harsher than I ever imagined.%K%P
这得不到回报的努力，对都子来说也许刻薄了些。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI won't go to Kyushu! I can't!\nI'll stay with you!\d%K%P
「我果然是不能去九州。\n永远要和理君在一起！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAs long as Ms. Honoka approves of the idea.\d%K%P
「穗香小姐…如果能得到她认可的话」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...!!\d%K%P
「…」%K%P
Still, I could kind of tell she came here precisely\nbecause Ms. Honoka opposed it.%K%P
正因为没有得到她的认可，\n都子才到这里来的。%K%P
The way I blurted that out despite knowing the truth... I\nmust've come off as a heartless adult in Toko's eyes.%K%P
明知道这一点却要提出这个条件的我\n在都子眼中，大概是个坏心眼的大人吧。%K%P
Everyone she turned to would only give her dry, adult-like\nexplanations. As a result, Toko likely started losing\ntrack of whom she could trust.%K%P
自己以外的人，敌人也好伙伴也好，大家都摆出一套大人的理论，\n也许都子都不知道该相信什么才好了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, Osamu...\d%K%P
「呐？理君…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dCould we elope?\d%K%P
「我们、私奔吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dLook, seriously...\d%K%P
「不，我说啊…」%K%P
All of which led her to this kind of solution.%K%P
所以，她才得出了这种结论。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'll work. I'm sure we could live happily working at some\nrun-down hot spring inn where no one would find us.\d%K%P
「我会工作的。\n在谁都不会发现的偏僻温泉旅馆，\n一起住在那里，一起工作，抓住只属于我们两人的幸福，好吗？」%K%P
She was Ms. Honoka's daughter through and through --\ndespite their superficial differences, both relied on\nthinking that was beyond myopic.%K%P
都子果然是穗香小姐的女儿啊…\n不管怎么说，这短路的思考毫不亚于她的母亲。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat about the boarding house? Or Shuusen?\nYou're going to throw all that away?\d%K%P
「公寓呢？秋泉大附呢？\n全部抛弃？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWouldn't that invalidate the tremendous amount of effort\nyou put into coming this far? Please, don't be that\nselfish... it makes me sad just hearing it.\d%K%P
「去年一整年都子的努力到底算什么啊？\n如此悲伤的任性之事，你可别说啊」%K%P
The bottom line was that I simply couldn't agree to it.%K%P
…也就是说，完全没有得到认可啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Yeah. I guess that's the logical answer.\nWhy does nobody understand me...?\d%K%P
「…也是啊。\n一般来说，会是这样子的。\n为什么她就是不明白呢…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI see.\d%K%P
「这样啊…」%K%P
It seemed like my resolute answer cooled her off a little.%K%P
这种连我都『完全无法认可』的感情论，\n被强行压到了她的身上…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIn the past, she was so much better to me...\nI even used to think of her as the best mother in the\nworld...\d%K%P
「以前明明是很温柔的…\n明明是把我的事最优先考虑的世界第一的妈妈的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMs. Honoka still loves you more than anyone else.\nAnd that's exactly why she won't acknowledge a man like\nme.\d%K%P
「现在穗香小姐也是最爱都子的啊。\n正因为如此，她才无法认可像我这样的男人啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy does it have to be Kyushu...?\nHe could easily refuse a ridiculous order like that.\d%K%P
「为什么要去九州啊…\n那样不讲理的命令，明明拒绝掉就好了的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYour idea is what's ridiculous here.\d%K%P
「那才是不讲理的请求啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMuch like I can't lightly throw my job away, Nishiguchi\ncan't remain here, either. ...That's what it means to be\nan employee.\d%K%P
「和我不能放弃现在的职场是一样，\n西口先生也无法留在这里。\n…工薪族，就是这么回事啊」%K%P
There were cases when people would be sent off overseas\nright after taking out a loan and buying a house here in\nJapan.%K%P
比如说，一个人向公司借钱建一栋独门独院，\n为了让其能偿还清，会被派到海外工作，这样的公司很多。%K%P
That wouldn't faze them, though. They'd do their best,\neven in a land completely alien to them -- all in order to\nsupport their beloved families back home.%K%P
但是，为了好不容易建好的家，为了所爱的家人，\n工薪族们也只能到不熟悉的异国只身努力。%K%P
It wasn't the company's order that sounded ridiculous, but\nrather the thought of not following it.%K%P
这种时候就在心中默念吧…\n公司的命令并非不讲理。\n不遵从才是不讲理。%K%P
...Whether or not that led to happiness is open for\ndiscussion, though.%K%P
…是否正确，暂且不说。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI-In that case... if Mom stayed behind...\d%K%P
「既、既然如此啊…\n妈妈留在这里的话…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAre you implying that Ms. Honoka should be unhappy for\nyour sake? You want her to give up on her own happiness?\d%K%P
「都子为了我，\n要让穗香小姐变得不幸吗？\n要让她放弃自己的幸福吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut then what about us...?\d%K%P
「可是啊，那样我们就…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can't say I'm fond of how you disrespect your\nmother...\d%K%P
「我可不喜欢如此不孝顺的都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...!!\d%K%P
「～～～！」%K%P
The moment I uttered those words, her face contorted in\nsuch an overwhelming way that I myself almost broke out in\ntears.%K%P
听到我说『不喜欢』的瞬间，\n都子的表情立刻就扭曲，都快要哭出来了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't want you to make such a sad decision, especially\nwhen you were the one who kept scolding me for not\nappreciating my parents enough.\d%K%P
「都子总是指责不孝顺的我，\n我不希望你做出这种悲伤的决断」%K%P
I felt terrible for saying all that, but I simply couldn't\nsupport this idea of hers.%K%P
虽然心中一扎一扎地疼，\n但我现在不能全面认可都子所说的话。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...This is the wish of the person whose life you saved.\nYou don't necessarily have to honor it, but at the very\nleast, I'd like you to keep it in your heart.\d%K%P
「…这是人生被你拯救了的一个人的请求。\n能不能遵守暂且不谈，但我希望你能牢记在心」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's unfair... When you say it like that... there's no\nway I can simply ignore it...\d%K%P
「这种说法…太卑鄙了。\n这就等于说要誓死遵守啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Thanks, Toko.\d%K%P
「…谢谢你，都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...You idiot!\d%K%P
「…笨蛋」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko... if you're done with your food, then please come\nover here.\d%K%P
「都子…吃不了的话，就到这边来吧」%K%P
I could barely contain my feelings of pure affection and\nlove.%K%P
心中过多的怜爱之情奔涌上来，\n让我的胸口被填得满满的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu...!\d%K%P
「理君…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOgh...\d%K%P
「喂喂…」%K%P
After noticing she hadn't touched her spoon in a while, I\ngestured for her to come closer -- the moment I did, she\nleapt into my arms.%K%P
我一向早已放下了勺子的都子招手，\n她就立刻在地板上滑着扑到我的胸口。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dKhh... I just... don't understand...\nWhy haven't we done something this nice in so long?\d%K%P
「…呜、呜…\n讨厌啦，真是的…\n好舒服啊，真是久违了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
With complaints still spilling forth from her lips, Toko\nburied her face in my chest, and took a few deep breaths.%K%P
就这样，她一边发着牢骚，\n一边把脸埋入我的胸口，使劲闻着气味。%K%P
Having not touched her in a long while, I added more\nstrength to my embrace and held Toko's entire body against\nmine.%K%P
我也享受着这久违了的触感，\n全身心地将那小小的身体抱在臂弯之下。%K%P
...I loved her more than anything.%K%P
…果然是可爱极了。%K%P
So much so that I was ready to cast aside all the grown-up\nlogic I'd been filling her head with and snatch her away,\njust the way she wanted it.%K%P
让我想要一口气把刚才所讲的大人的道理全部舍弃，\n渴求都子，抱这个女孩。%K%P
However... I... we...%K%P
但是…\n现在的我，现在的我们…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI think I could manage to live without you, if it's for a\nshort while.\d%K%P
「我啊…如果只是短时间内的话，\n即使没有都子，也是能活下去的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI don't want to live without you.\d%K%P
「我…\n不愿意理君不在…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI feel the same, but... think about what we have to do\nnow to win this.\d%K%P
「我也不愿意啊…\n但是，为了最后的胜利，得去考虑现在所应该做的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat do you mean...?\d%K%P
「最后…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMy goal is to have you nurse me on my deathbed.\d%K%P
「我的目标…\n照顾都子，直到人生的最后」%K%P
Indeed, tears never came in singles.%K%P
泪珠果然是要流下两滴以上的啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...That's my goal. And I'm not yielding it to you.\d%K%P
「…那是我的目标啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dJust from an age perspective, I'd say I have the clear\nadvantage here.\d%K%P
「无论是寿命还是年龄差，我都是具有压倒性优势的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut you never took into consideration how unfortunate\nyoung beauties tend to pass away early due to illness. At\nleast in literature.\d%K%P
「薄命的美少女最后病倒了，\n也有这种文学性的…」%K%P
Oh, she called herself a beauty.%K%P
啊，她自称『美』了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf that happens, I'll follow you soon enough, so be\nprepared to be alone in Heaven, because I'll be going\nstraight to Hell.\d%K%P
「要是那样的话，我随后就会去的。\n你要做好孤身一人在天国的心理准备啊。\n我是会坠入无间地狱的人，无法和你再见了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou're so mean... I can't believe it...!\d%K%P
「坏心眼…坏心眼」%K%P
I thought that was a pretty cool line to say, but now\nthings had deteriorated to something akin to a fight\nbetween two grade schoolers. We were both getting all\nteary-eyed, too.%K%P
本来是想要说点好事的，\n但为什么会变成这种幼稚的争论啊。\n而且我们为了彼此都流泪了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dListen, Toko... we're not doing anything wrong!\d%K%P
「我说，都子…\n我们什么错事都没做！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理君…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...We're just doing something most people don't agree\nwith.\d%K%P
「…只是做了不能做的事而已」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
