How many times would I have to console myself tonight\nbefore the urge would fade? I'd best burn the memory of\nToko's skin and scent into my mind as hard as I could.%K%P
今晚…就允许我稍微大胆一次吧。\n就趁现在，将都子的触感和气味刻入脑海里吧。%K%P
