%LC麻实
\dUm, look, I don't mean to sound harsh, but this feels\nlike giving away my final pennies to a burglar who's\nalready robbed me blind. I mean, I'm not implying you\nstole my man... Well, maybe I am.\d%K%P
「怎么说呢，就是那个吧？虽然说法很糟糕，\n不过这应该叫『赔了夫人又折兵（向小偷付钱）』吧…\n啊，不，我倒也不是觉得你是偷腥猫什么的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMs. Kouno... Ms. Kouno...\nI... I have no one else to turn to...\d%K%P
「老师、老师…\n我、我、我啊…\n依靠谁都无所谓了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnd I'm saying I'm the last person you should seek out.\d%K%P
「所以我都说了，至少不要来依靠我啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dO-Osamu doesn't seem to consider this a huge deal at\nall... I'm starting to question if he even loves me...\nand... and...\d%K%P
「理、理君也是，沉着得不得了，\n“他是不是真的爱我呢”，\n我也是七想八想的…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're just pushing the knife deeper into my heart\nnow...\d%K%P
「我都说了，正是这种商谈，才让人伤心啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHahh... uah, uahh... uehh...!\nWhat should I do? What can I do...?!\d%K%P
「呜呜、呜、呜呜…呜呜…\n怎么办，该怎么办才好啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dGod...!!\d%K%P
「………………………真是的！！！」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI understand what you're trying to say, but we've already\ncome to a decision.\d%K%P
「老师您想表达的我明白了…\n但我已经决定了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAre you certain it's a decision that your daughter...\nthat Mitoko wholeheartedly agrees with?\d%K%P
「这是您的女儿…\n美都子也能心服口服的结论吗？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dA student earning a scholarship with Shuusen Preparatory\nis a rarity, even at our school -- we're lucky to get one\nperson per year. It's not something just anyone can\naccomplish, but your daughter went and did it.\d%K%P
「秋泉大附的免费生啊，\n那在我们学校是一年都难考出一个来的，\n门槛非常高啊。可是她漂亮地突破进去了」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dToko has always been a hard worker.\d%K%P
「嗯，小都子是个努力的孩子…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dShe had no parents to look after her, had to manage a\nboarding house on her own, and was completely without\nmoney. Yet in the face of those hardships, she still\npassed all her tests.\d%K%P
「父母不在，没有钱，又不得不维持着整栋公寓。\n在这种逆境之下，她成功走了过来。\n您是知道的吧？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dLook, I... I've already apologized for last year.\nAnd Toko forgave me...\d%K%P
「那个…去年的事，我已经道歉了。\n小都子也说原谅我了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnd after all her efforts finally bore fruit... her\nmother comes back, and instead of praising her, tells her\nto throw everything away?\d%K%P
「拼命努力，对回来的母亲笑脸相迎…\n您对她的回报就是这突然的搬家吗？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dIt's a decision I made with her future in mind.\d%K%P
「所以说，正因为要考虑到那孩子的将来…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDo you really understand what Mitoko fought so hard to\nachieve this past year?\d%K%P
「美都子在这一年里，\n究竟是为了什么在努力，\n您真的明白吗？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI really do wonder about that myself...\d%K%P
「那孩子在这一年里…\n究竟是为何而努力的呢」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Excuse me?\d%K%P
「…什么？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dAt first, it might have been to protect the boarding\nhouse, when she was still waiting for me to come back.\d%K%P
「最开始也许是为了守护公寓。\n也许是等着我的归来」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAt first...? She was waiting for you this entire\ntime...!\d%K%P
「什么最开始啊…她是一直在等着您…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dBut her goal shifted mid-way through. Eventually, she\nstarted to work hard both at school and home just so she\ncould spend more time with that older man. To make him\nlove her.\d%K%P
「可是，目的在中途就变了。\n想要和年长的他在一起，想要被他喜欢，\n于是努力升学、做家务、工作…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWha...?!\d%K%P
「什…！？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dShe might not have realized it herself, but soon enough,\nshe forgot all about me and started chasing after a dream\nunfit for a normal student, pouring all her effort into a\nmistaken ideal.\d%K%P
「不知不觉就把我给忘了，\n开始追逐与身为一个学生不相符的梦想，\n朝着错误的方向拼命努力了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're wrong! It's true that Mitoko fell in love along\nthe way, but she never forgot you, not for a single\nmoment!\d%K%P
「不对！\n美都子的确是恋爱了，\n但即使如此，她也从未忘记您…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dWouldn't the school also be responsible for what happened\nto her?\d%K%P
「而且，那孩子变成现在这个样子，\n当时负责指导她的学校一方，\n也是有责任的吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「………诶？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI heard you knew those two were dating. How could you\nacknowledge such an abnormal relationship?\d%K%P
「我听说了，\n老师你是知道那两个人在交往的…\n为什么还要认可那种没有常识的关系啊？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI've even heard rumors that you used to be married to\nthat man... Mr. Yoshimura. ...Is that true?\d%K%P
「更有传闻说，\n那个芳村先生以前和老师你结过婚。\n…没错吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat if it is?\d%K%P
「那个…我无法否认就是了」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI'd really like to know how you can watch those two and\nturn a blind eye, given your position.\d%K%P
「既然是这样，眼睁睁地放任那两人，\n你究竟是有什么企图啊？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Grrr.\d%K%P
「………（唔）」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI can't help but question the moral standards of your\nschool. Just what sort of things did you teach my daughter\nin there?\d%K%P
「说实话，我很怀疑你们的学校。\n究竟是怎么教育我们家小都子的…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou sure talk big for a tramp that ran out on her\ndaughter with some man!\d%K%P
「和男人跑了的母亲有什么脸说这种话！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\d?!\d%K%P
「！？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDo you seriously think you have any right to trample on\nthe happiness she achieved after a whole year's worth of\ntears and suffering?!\d%K%P
「那女孩在这一年里…\n受挫了，哭了，又努力了，但努力没有得到回报，又哭了，\n经历了这些而终于到手的幸福，你有践踏的权力吗！？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dM-Ms. Kouno...?\d%K%P
「老、老师…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dShe even picked a fight with me for the sake of her\nfeelings... and came out on top. You have no idea how\npissed I'll be if her happiness falls apart because of all\nthis bullshit!\d%K%P
「那女孩都做到了这个地步…\n为了达成自己的心意都不惜把我挤掉了哦？\n这样她都无法获得幸福的话，我是无法接受的！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dU-U-U... Um... I...\d%K%P
「那、那、那…那个」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat? You actually have something to say? Just so you\nknow, I'm not talking as her homeroom teacher right now.\nIf you come barging into the school later, I'm just going\nto ignore you.\d%K%P
「什么啊？你还有什么好说的吗？\n话说在前头，我现在已经不是那女孩的班主任了。\n之后你就算去学校怒吼也只会被人嘲笑的」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dI... I wasn't going to... I just...\d%K%P
「我、我，那个…\n刚、刚才那不是我的真实想法…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThen say what you really think, Ms. Cuckoo-Bird! Your\ndaughter's an admirable girl who could survive anywhere in\nthe world! I hate to admit it, but she's one of the nicest\npeople I know!\d%K%P
「那就把真心话说出来啊，扒手小姐！\n你的女儿无论在世界哪个地方，都是个毫不给人丢脸、\n非常坚强…虽然令人不甘心、但是非常可爱的女孩啊！」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dAh, ah, ah...\d%K%P
「啊、啊、啊…」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dP-Please wait!\nI implore you not to push her any further!\d%K%P
「请、请等一下！\n先停停，老师！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dGuh?!\d%K%P
「！？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dH-Haruhiko!\d%K%P
「晴、晴彦先生！」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dPlease, have some mercy on Honoka! It was hard enough for\nher to leave the boarding house, and it's a sin she'll\ncarry with her to the grave! If you need someone to blame,\nthen blame me...!\d%K%P
「请您不要再这样责备穗香小姐了！\n她在外面也是很辛苦的！\n全都是因为我的无能…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou...?\d%K%P
「你…」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dI'm begging you... find it in your heart to let this go,\nat least for today. Please!\d%K%P
「所以说今天就…\n看在我的面子上，不要再说了吧。\n…拜托了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI salute you, Teach.\d%K%P
「那么…老师您辛苦了～」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNgh, ngh, ngh... bwahh.\nGeez, what the hell was that?!\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯、嗯………噗啊啊～。\n够了～，真是成不了事啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm sorry...\nI shouldn't have asked you for something so unreasonable.\d%K%P
「抱歉啊…\n都是我说了没有道理的话」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dIt's not your fault, Toko.\d%K%P
「又不是小都子的错」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYes. As unreasonable as your requests are, I decided to\ntake them on. And from then on, it was my responsibility\nto see them through. ...Besides, I utterly failed at\ntrying to convince your mother, anyway.\d%K%P
「是啊。无论你说的有多么没有道理，\n接受了的我再怎么说也得自己承担责任了。\n…而且，到头来还是没能说服她」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou sure are one complicated woman, Teach. How come\nyou're helping your enemy when you still haven't given up\non Osamu yourself?\d%K%P
「不过啊，老师你扮演的角色也真是头疼啊。\n明明自己还完全没有放弃理君的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI can differentiate between work and private matters. She\nmay have graduated, but Mitoko is still one of my biggest\nproblem students. I can't just ignore her plea for help.\d%K%P
「工作和私事是两码事。\n虽说已经是毕业生了，学生有烦恼，我去帮一把是理所当然的。\n况且还是去年最严重的问题学生，就更不能坐视不管了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm sorry...\d%K%P
「对不起…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat said, I'm not sure if I can just chalk this up to\nbeing a work-related matter. I'm starting to wonder if I'm\nactually a masochist.\d%K%P
「不过，这件事到底算不上是工作啊。\n我啊，看来果然是有Ｍ体质呢…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'd say the fact she's able to talk about these things in\nfront of her students is both her most endearing part...\nand something that disqualifies her as a teacher.\d%K%P
「虽然这不该是在有学生在场的情况下展开的话题，\n不过现在对这个人最亲近是作为老师的失职啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dSeriously. I sometimes feel like she's almost as bad as\nyou.\d%K%P
「真的是。\n毫不含蓄的夏夜小姐也是争得了一场精彩的较量啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...I see you've finally developed a sharp tongue,\nprincess.\d%K%P
「…公主也这么说啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dToko, are you drinking?\nLet's just forget all about the bad things for a while.\nOkay?\d%K%P
「小都子要喝吗？\n嘛，可以暂时忘记讨厌的事哦？要吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThis thing is disgusting, Himeo...\d%K%P
「这很不妙啊，姬绪姐…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dReally? Doesn't it taste like cucumbers?\d%K%P
「是么？\n黄瓜味的要吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dC'mon, princess, why do you always have weird stuff like\nthat?\d%K%P
「为什么你严格挑选的净是这种饮料啊，公主」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnyway, where's good ol' Osamu when his little lover's\nover here, feeling all miserable?\d%K%P
「话说回来…\n明明小小的恋人都苦恼到这个地步了，\n关键人物的理准备怎么做啊？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThere was no need to emphasize my height...\d%K%P
「我觉得您也没必要加上『小小的』吧…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAccording to Ms. Kinoshita, he's working day and night\nwith no breaks, even on weekends.\d%K%P
「我问过办公室的木下小姐了，\n他好像是在拼命地深夜、休息日加班中」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIn other words, the usual pattern.\nNo wonder he doesn't answer my phone calls.\d%K%P
「也就是一如既往的吧。\n怪不得往家里打电话都没人接」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Wait, you were in contact with him?\d%K%P
「…喂，你擅自联络理了？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHey, I'm lending him my room. I can at least call him,\ncan't I?\d%K%P
「毕竟是借的我的屋子啊，\n只是问问近况有什么大碍的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThe fact you haven't fully moved out of that apartment is\nsuspicious by itself. What on earth were you planning when\nyou moved in here?\d%K%P
「话说你到现在都还没搬走本来就很可疑了。\n你究竟是带着什么目的搬进这栋公寓的？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'd love to hear about that, too.\d%K%P
「那个…我也想知道」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dC'mon, Ms. Landlord... I thought we cured you of that\njealous streak last year.\d%K%P
「房东小姐…\n你这嫉妒之心在一年前就已经解决了吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Well, whatever.\nSo Osamu's acting like usual?\d%K%P
「…算了。\n也就是说理还是老样子？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHm? Yeah, he's a little busybody over at work, as you'd\nexpect. He makes few mistakes and is pushing the entire\nteam forward. The vice chief of our accounting department\nhas been in high spirits lately.\d%K%P
「嗯？啊啊，还是一如既往地拼命工作，\n失误少，出得了成果。\n经理部的平木副部长似乎心情是相当好」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHmm... It does sound like he's living his life as usual.\nMeanwhile, Ms. Landlord over here is about ready to off\nherself.\d%K%P
「哼嗯…真的是一如既往啊。\n明明房东小姐都这么难受了的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEehh...\d%K%P
「呜…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou don't have to pick on her. ...And neither do I, I\nguess.\d%K%P
「你们也别这么责备他了。\n…同时也要自我克制啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHe seems to be short on money, though. He only has self-\nmade rice balls for lunch, and never eats out for dinner.\nAlso, the only thing anyone's seen him drink lately is\nwater.\d%K%P
「可是，他好像在为钱发愁。\n午饭只是吃自己做的饭团，\n晚上也绝不去外面吃饭，饮料也只是喝水」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, his financial troubles didn't exactly start today,\nbut that does sound worse than usual.\d%K%P
「虽然他总是在为钱发愁…\n不过这次似乎比以往更甚」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dOne of our employees volunteered to lend him some money,\nbut he refused, claiming he'd only have to endure until\nthe end of the month, and that it would be meaningless\nunless he saved up himself.\d%K%P
「所以，好像同事提出了要借钱给他，\n不过他以这个月要忍受住为由拒绝了。\n似乎还说了不是自己挣的就没意义什么的…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIs it the property tax again?\nI mean, the season's right around the corner.\d%K%P
「…是要缴纳这里的固定资产税吗？\n今年又到了这个季度啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dSurely Ms. Honoka and her fiance will pay that this year.\nBesides, I highly doubt they'd accept money from him,\ngiven the current circumstances.\d%K%P
「穗香小姐的未婚夫是要支付那个的吧。\n而且照现在的情况来看，应该也不会接受他的钱」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThen what on earth is it? These two don't even have that\nmuch time left... so what is that slug thinking...?\d%K%P
「那是为什么啊？\n而且啊，现在时间已经没多少了，\n那个慢性子还在做什么啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu's not a slug...!\d%K%P
「理君才不是慢性子呢…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou can take his side all you want after you stop\nwhimpering!\d%K%P
「你在这点上都庇护他的话，这不是成心让我伤心吗！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNo need to get this angry every single time...\nThough I guess I should also watch myself around this\ngirl.\d%K%P
「您也别再继续纠结了。\n…同时也要自我克制，对吧」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dHere's your tea.\n...Have you managed to calm down a little?\d%K%P
「给，茶。\n…差不多冷静下来了吧？」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dTh... Thank you, Haruhiko. Phew...\d%K%P
「啊…谢谢你，晴彦先生。\n呼…」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dIt... might be hard right now, but you have to endure it.\nIt's all for the sake of our future... as well as\nMitoko's.\d%K%P
「现在…在各方面上都很辛苦，不过还是要忍耐啊。\n这都是为了我们…为了我们和美都子啊」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dYes, I know. I understand, Haruhiko. It's just that...\d%K%P
「嗯，我知道的，我知道的啊，晴彦先生。\n可是…」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...What's the matter?\d%K%P
