That was because I kept groveling in front of Vice Chief\nHiragi, begging him to let me add the expected overtime\npay to the rest of this month.%K%P
那个嘛，实质上是５月的加班费都预算进去了的，\n搞得平木副部长都哭了。%K%P
...You could say I was getting some advance payment.%K%P
…嘛，总而言之就是预支的工资了。%K%P
