For an employee that caused a shift of power in the\ncompany mere weeks after getting hired, then took two\nmonths of paid leave due to an injury, I felt like I was\nbeing treated too well.%K%P
对我这个半路出家、造成了公司突然合并、\n那之后又因为受伤而两个月没上班的超级不良职员来说，\n这个待遇真是好过头了。%K%P
Yet Vice Chief Hiragi, despite having to take his\nmysterious medicine again, agreed to lend me an ear and\ngranted my request.%K%P
即使如此，平木副部长却一边吞着谜之药片，\n一边放任着我的任性。%K%P
