The little box in my left hand held a ring with an emerald\n-- Toko's birthstone -- a platinum band, and a diamond\nring.%K%P
在左手里打开的小盒子里，\n装着都子的生日宝石——绿宝石。\n以及覆盖有白金的钻石戒指。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's last year's property tax...\nWill you take it for me?\d%K%P
「去年的固定资产税…\n你能收下吗？」%K%P
After it spent an entire year in the store window of a\npawnshop, I used two months' worth of my own salary to get\nit back.%K%P
在当铺橱窗里展示了一年，\n到头来，还是靠着我『现在两个月的工资』，赎了回来。%K%P
Back then, I didn't know it was her birthstone... I didn't\neven know she existed. I could never even imagine it would\nend up connecting us.%K%P
当时我还不知道这是都子的生日宝石，\n而且就连都子的存在都不知道，\n更不知道这宝石连接着我们两人。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
And so, after all this time, I put that ring --  far too\nbig for her -- on the ring finger of Toko's left hand.%K%P
在都子左手的无名指上，\n由于过大而咕噜转动的戒指，\n现在已经牢牢地连接了我们。%K%P
