\dThank you... very much.\d%K%P
「非常…感谢」%K%P
Ms. Kaya, who helped almost as much as Toko did.%K%P
继都子之后，拯救了我的夏夜小姐。%K%P
Himeo, who gave me the opportunity to pull myself back to\nmy feet.%K%P
给予我真正重新崛起契机的姬绪小姐。%K%P
Mr. Retired, who always helped me when it really mattered.%K%P
总是在最后的最后，稍稍帮上忙的老爷子。%K%P
Yasunaga, who taught me about the harshness of the world.%K%P
亲身告诉我世间诸多严苛的八须永君。%K%P
Mr. Kumazaki, who, from start to finish, remained a\nperfect example of how not to behave.%K%P
我最好的反面教师熊崎先生。%K%P
And finally... Asami.%K%P
以及………麻实。%K%P
Despite knowing that our relationship was a mistake, they\nall helped guide us along with kindness in their eyes.%K%P
明知道我们…\n我和都子两人是走在错误的道路上，\n即使如此依然守护着我们的人…%K%P
Their presence was enough to transport us to an imaginary\nchapel.%K%P
他们把我们带到了想像中的小教堂。%K%P
