%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dA relative, huh? Then maybe it's about time you told\neveryone your real name, given how close you already feel\nto us. Go on... Mr. Satou Masao.\d%K%P
「亲戚…是吧？\n那你干脆把自己真正名字告诉我们吧。\n诶？佐藤正夫先生？」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dWha...?!\d%K%P
「什…！？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dYour real age was a far bigger surprise than your name,\nthough. I didn't expect you to actually be 22.\d%K%P
「比起真名，有更让人吃惊的…\n他不是２７岁，而是２２岁啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEhh? H-He was five years younger than me?!\d%K%P
「诶诶！？\n比、比我还要小５岁！？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWhoa, just how much younger does that make you compared\nto Ms. Landlord? I don't think you're all that different\nfrom Laid-off and the li'l landlord at this point.\d%K%P
「喂喂，你啊，你和房东小姐相差多少岁啊？\n这样的话，你完全没资格对失业者和房东妹妹的事说三道四嘛」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dP-Please, hold on a second!\nWhat on earth is going on here?! I'm completely lost!\d%K%P
「等、等一下啊！\n刚才大家说的事，\n我完全听不懂！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dYou should know that the investigation records remain in\nthe database even when the victims don't press charges.\d%K%P
「人啊，就算是因为被亲自控告而没有遭到起诉，\n搜查记录也能很好地留下来的哦」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dSatou Masao, born in 198x in Hyogo. At the age of 17, he\nforms a relationship with a 33-year-old hostess, sells her\napartment after a few months of being together, then takes\noff with the money.\d%K%P
「佐藤正夫，１９８×年８月１９日出生。兵库县出身。\n１７岁的时候，和３３岁的空姐同居几个月之后，\n卖掉了她公寓的全部财产，然后逃亡」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWhoa... That's way more screwed up than anything I ever\ndid.\d%K%P
「呜哇…这比我还要重口」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dFrom then on, he repeats the same kind of scheme over\ntwenty times with reported damages totalling close to a\nbillion yen. The guy's one of the most charismatic\nmarriage swindlers in the country.\d%K%P
「那之后，在关西地区也用同样的手法，\n造成的被害者超过２０人，被害总额高达１０亿，\n就是这样的超级结婚欺诈师」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWhy are they all so easily tricked by a completely\nunremarkable guy like this...?\d%K%P
「为什么如此简单就被骗了啊…？\n被这个没什么与众不同的男人」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'd rather be exploited by Osamu.\d%K%P
「明明被理君骗有价值得多的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu would never fall so low as to trick women.\d%K%P
「理才不会做出哄骗女人这种过分的事」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI really wish he fell that low for me. I would've been\nhappy if he said I was the only one for him. Even if it\nwas a lie.\d%K%P
「我倒是想被他骗啊。\n真希望他能对我说，『我只对你一个人说谎』…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Now I see why these losers are so successful.\d%K%P
「…正因为有这样的女人，这种人渣才不会消失。\n我是瞬间领悟了这一点啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dBut you guys sure managed to find out a lot about this\nKansai swindler. I mean, didn't Ms. Landlord meet him in\nHokkaido?\d%K%P
「不过话说回来，\n竟然把关系欺诈师的身份给揭露出来了。\n房东小姐是在北海道认识他的吧？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dApparently, the request came from the former law\nprofessor of the country's top prosecutor. It resulted in\nthe entire legal world coming to a complete halt for a few\ndays.\d%K%P
「毕竟是有负责检查的一号人物\n恶鬼一般的原法学院教授发号施令啊…\n国内的司法界似乎都一时停摆了」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dOh, I see... Good thing you managed to expose him in\ntime.\d%K%P
「哼嗯，这样啊。\n不过找到了真是好啊」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dYo, couldn't you at least try and act a bit more\nsurprised?\d%K%P
「你倒是多吃惊一些啊…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHeh, Hattsuan's completely right -- all's well that ends\nwell.\d%K%P
「嘛嘛，小八说的没错，\n结果好就一切都好」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWell then, do you have anything to say?\d%K%P
「那…你还有什么想说的吗？」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dS-So what if I made a few mistakes in the past? I 'm\nreformed now, and I work as a civil servant.\d%K%P
「有、有那种黑历史又如何？\n我现在早就改头换面，成为了公务员…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dNo, you don't. You think I haven't looked into that? How\nwould you even work for this country with a fake name,\nanyway?\d%K%P
「没啦没啦。\n那个也证明是假的了。\n说到底，用假名怎么能在国家机关就职啊？」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...Did you suspect me right from the start?\d%K%P
「…你们从最开始就怀疑我了吗？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWell, at least the old tenants realized you were fishy\nright away.\d%K%P
「至少，以前的住户一下子就察觉到了」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dWhy...?\d%K%P
「为什么…？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWell...\d%K%P
「那个嘛…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYeah...\d%K%P
「是吧？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dThat's right...\d%K%P
「也是啊」%K%P
%LCKihee & Yoshinori & Buntarou
%LC喜兵卫＆吉则＆文太郎
\dWe've yet to see Ms. Landlord bring home a genuinely\nupstanding man.\d%K%P
「房东小姐能迷上的男人，\n没有一个是正经的啊」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAh... now that you mention it...\d%K%P
「啊～，也是啊，的确如此」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHow hopeless of a woman is she?\nI get the feeling she might actually give Teach a run for\nher money.\d%K%P
「多么没用的女人…\n说不定比老师还要没用」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dCould you please stop using me as the basis for your\ncomparisons?\d%K%P
「所以说在这种地方不要总是扯上我啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dSo yeah, I approached you multiple times, trying to make\nyou slip up, but you were one tough nut to crack. Gotta\nsay, I kinda started admiring your skill.\d%K%P
「嘛，就是这样，想要让你原形毕露，\n我故意向你搭过好几次话，可你就是不露出狐狸尾巴。\n真是值得尊敬啊」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dSo that's... what you were talking about back then...\d%K%P
「『值得尊敬』是这种意思吗…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI was pretty confident I could outdo anyone in terms of\nacting, but dude, you sure demolished my pride over\nthere.\d%K%P
「我觉得你在话剧方面的演技对大部分人都不会落于下风啊，\n真是够打击人的自信了…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dBut hey, at least I mastered your voice.\d%K%P
「嘛，虽说拜此所赐，对话完美地让人掌控了就是」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dEek?!\d%K%P
「呀！？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dSounds just like you, doesn't it? Ms. Landlord couldn't\ntell the difference, either. I sure am glad I managed to\nmaster it before she brought you the ownership papers and\nall that.\d%K%P
「很像吧？房东小姐也没有察觉到哦。\n在公寓的权利书被拿走之前，\n能及时控制住真是太好了」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dWait, what...?!\d%K%P
「权利书…！？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHonoka, I'm sorry, but there are some papers for you that\nI left with Mr. Kumazaki from Room #2. Could you take them\noff his hands when you have the chance?\d%K%P
「穗香小姐，不好意思。\n有一份为二号房的熊崎先生准备的文件，\n您能将其交还回去给他保存吗？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dThe papers you got were all duplicates I made.\nYou couldn't tell from a single look, could you?\d%K%P
「你们所拿的文件，\n是我制作的复印件。\n乍看上去，分辨不出来吧？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dBut y'know, what's the point of tricking her out of that\nland, anyway? You'd be inheriting her mortgage and all, so\nthere wouldn't be much profit for you unless you rebuilt\neverything.\d%K%P
「不过啊，就算你这样骗来了这里的土地，\n抵押品啊还有其他各种乱七八糟的事项，也不能赚多少钱哦？\n除非公寓被拆掉进行再开发」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWell, our proprietress has a penchant for vanity, so I'm\nalmost certain she never told him about those.\d%K%P
「老板娘啊，她对什么事都追求虚荣，\n没有把这么重要的事告诉你啊」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...So what are you going to do with me now?\d%K%P
「…你们说要我怎么办？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOh, so that's his real voice.\d%K%P
「喔～，好嗓门」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt definitely feels lacking in the intimidating\ndepartment.\nWell, I suppose that's only a given at his age.\d%K%P
「魄力不足啊。\n毕竟还年轻，也难怪啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dOsamu's over thirty and he's not any more intimidating\nthan this guy...\d%K%P
「不过理先生都过３０了，还是没魄力啊」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dDo you really believe you could do something about me,\neven if all of your guesswork turned out to be on the\nspot?\d%K%P
「就算你们的胡说八道是正确的…\n你们觉得我能被逮捕吗？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHmm, well... I asked Shibata about that, too, but his\nvictims all adamantly refused to talk to the police.\d%K%P
「嗯～，那个啊，柴田君也打听过了，\n被他所骗的被害者们，她们好像都\n对此保持沉默呢」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dWell, of course. I haven't stolen anything from anyone.\nI simply take what they give me on their own.\d%K%P
「那是啊。\n因为我从来没有向女人掠夺过什么。\n我都是心怀感激地接受了对方说要送给我的东西」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWh-What...? So if Ms. Honoka doesn't press charges...\d%K%P
「什、什么啊…\n那，这次的事件穗香小姐也不会控诉…？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNo way she ever would. I'm pretty sure she'd choose to\nbelieve in happy delusions over whatever we tell her.\d%K%P
「看她那个样子，怎么可能去控诉啊。\n无论我们怎么向她告知真相，\n她也只会对自己一厢情愿的回忆深信不疑」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dThat's too bad. And you thought you had me... aha,\nahaha...\d%K%P
「真是遗憾啊，各位。\n你们难得追查到这一步了的，\n啊哈、啊哈哈…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dSo you see, we decided to instead destroy you publicly.\d%K%P
「…因此，这次以期万全，\n会把你从社会上抹杀的，放心好了」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...What?\d%K%P
「………什么？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI uploaded your name and pictures along with detailed\ninformation of your crimes to all major social networks.\d%K%P
「把你的真名和照片发到社交网站上，\n把你至今为止的犯罪史也写成日志发表出来」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...Huh?\d%K%P
「…哈？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI shared the link on all the largest internet forums,\ntoo.\d%K%P
「然后，把链接贴到巨大揭示板上，\n稍加散播」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「…诶？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI also made a special site and blog for you, where you\nbrag about all your deeds for everyone to see.\d%K%P
「『自主』创立制作网站，\n个人博客也『被人』发现，\n新的犯罪史一个接一个暴露于光天化日之下…在这里」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dHere, you can check it out with your phone.\d%K%P
「瞧吧，这个这个。\n手机上也能看到」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dOh, he's right.\d%K%P
「啊，真的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dLet's see... Hunter of Middle-Aged Women, Satou Masao,\nAge 22. ...Ugh, couldn't you come up with a better title?\d%K%P
「哪里哪里…？\n三十岁妇女杀手佐藤正夫２２岁的总汇页面？\n…你这标题能取得好一点吗？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI'm taking suggestions both for the title and anything\nelse related to the boards. Just start posting and boost\nthose numbers.\d%K%P
「包含新标题在内的改善方案正在揭示板募集。\n填写的人越来越多了」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dOh, it even has a picture gallery. Check this out. Ain't\nit a work of art? I took it with a hidden camera when we\nwere talking.\d%K%P
「喔～脸也有很好地展露啊～。\n呐呐，拍得很漂亮吧？\n这是在我和你说话的时候偷偷拍的」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dWh-Wh-Wh... What the fuck...?!\nThat's against the law, you know!\d%K%P
「你、你、你…你们…\n这是犯罪吧！？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWhat are you talking about?\nIt's perfectly okay to have a little crime in here.\d%K%P
「瞧你这话说的。\n犯罪描写当然是ＯＫ的啦」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dWhat?!\d%K%P
「为什么啊！？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWe're X-rated, anyway.\d%K%P
「诶诶，Ｘ－ｒａｔｅｄ」%K%P
%LCEveryone
%LC全员
\dOh...\d%K%P
「喔～」%K%P
%LCHaruhiko
%LC晴彦
\dC-C-C... Cut the crap, you bastards!\d%K%P
「开、开、开…开什么玩笑！」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
To Ms. Honoka.%K%P
致穗香小姐。%K%P
It pains my heart to leave while the memories of that\nordeal are still so fresh in your mind. I do not for a\nmoment expect forgiveness.%K%P
把心灵伤痛终于治好了的你留下是件很让人心酸的事。\n我不期许能得到你的原谅。%K%P
But I have faith that one day, you will come to understand\nmy decision.%K%P
但是，我相信你总有一天会明白的。%K%P
With that thought to sustain me, I will be able to press\non. Even as I continue to survive on my own, my heart will\nalways be at your side.%K%P
相信着那一天的到来，我努力着。\n带着对你的思念，独自活下去。%K%P
I will go to Fukuoka by myself. That is something I have\nalready decided and won't change my mind about.%K%P
我自己一个人去福冈。\n这是已经决定了的事。%K%P
I'm certain you already know why.%K%P
原因…也许我不说你也明白吧。%K%P
I was suspicious of Mr. Yoshimura at the beginning.\nI suspected him to be a swindler trying to get his hands\non Mitoko's fortune.%K%P
我最开始是怀疑着芳村先生的。\n怀疑他诱惑了美都子，想要把她骗得一无所有，\n我以为他是一个如此可怕的欺诈师。%K%P
However, I was proven utterly wrong earlier today.%K%P
但是，就在今天，我发现自己完全弄错了。%K%P
After seeing those two together, I realized how rotten a\nperson I was for daring to doubt them.%K%P
我被他们两人纯粹的心意所打动，\n都让我感觉自己真是个卑贱的小人了，\n实在是无地自容。%K%P
I can't just trample all over their happiness for my own\nsake. I'm so sorry, Honoka, but I can't be at your side.%K%P
所以，我要把那两人的幸福放在优先考虑。\n穗香小姐，对不起。\n我无法伴你同行了。%K%P
You mustn't blame Mitoko or Mr. Yoshimura.%K%P
但是…\n请你不要恨美都子和芳村先生。%K%P
They were simply honest with their feelings and did\neverything they could to attain happiness, much like we\ndid.%K%P
他们只是拼命想要传达自己的爱而已。\n这和我们俩彼此的思绪别无二致。%K%P
I'll make sure to contact you once things have calmed\ndown. And Honoka... please don't let this letter get you\ndown.%K%P
暂时安顿下来之后，我会联络你的。\n还愿穗香小姐你多多保重。%K%P
With love, Nishiguchi Haruhiko.%K%P
你的西口晴彦。%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dThis cannot be...\d%K%P
「…骗人的吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMom...\d%K%P
「妈妈…」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dThis has to be some kind of joke. This can't be true!\nYou're all just pulling a prank, aren't you?!\d%K%P
「这是开的什么玩笑啊？\n是啊，这是骗人的！\n一定是大家在合起伙来逗我！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI'm afraid... we're not...\d%K%P
「老板娘…很遗憾…」%K%P
Mr. Retired shook his head with a pained expression on his\nface.%K%P
老爷子一脸悲伤地摇着头。%K%P
The rest either averted their gazes or stared at the\nground, trying not to look into Ms. Honoka's eyes,\nwordlessly conveying the severity of the situation.%K%P
其他人也都低着头，将目光移开，\n只是用自己的态度传达着这封信内容的真实。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dMr. Nishiguchi must've been looking for a way to make\neveryone happy.\d%K%P
「西口先生似乎一直在烦恼。\n烦恼着怎样才能让大家都获得幸福…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dRealizing that to be impossible, he decided to back\ndown.\d%K%P
「但是，当他明白已经无可奈何时，\n也就只好自己退出了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThat's the sort of person he was...\nKind-hearted to a fault, even in comparison to Osamu.\d%K%P
「他就是这样的人啊…\n比理君还要老好人」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dMen are all so stupid!\d%K%P
「男人啊，真的净是些笨蛋呢」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
%XS10\dSorry, but I'm not going to participate in this farce.\d %XE%K%P
「这番闹剧，我是不会参和的啊」%K%P
%LCHonoka
%LC穗香
\dTh-Th-Th... This can't be...! There's no way...\nThere's no way Haruhiko could... cast me aside like\nthis...!\d%K%P
